\"data\";s:7:\"lang:en\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:17:\"autoptimize cache\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"bug\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"divi\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"elegant themes\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://blog.futtta.be/?p=10763\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:335:\"A heads-up to Autoptimize users who are using Divi (and potentially other Elegant Theme&#8217;s themes); as discovered and documented by Chris, Divi purges Autoptimize&#8217;s cache every time a page/ post is published (or saved?). To be clear; there is no reason for the AO cache being cleared at that point as: A new page/ post [...]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"frank\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1885:\"<p>A heads-up to Autoptimize users who are using Divi (and potentially other Elegant Theme&#8217;s themes); as <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/topic/slow-backend-page-saving/#post-10877049\">discovered and documented by Chris</a>, Divi purges Autoptimize&#8217;s cache every time a page/ post is published (or saved?).</p>\n<p>To be clear; there is no reason for the AO cache being cleared at that point as:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>A new page/ post does not introduce new CSS/ JS</li>\n<li>Even if new CSS/ JS would be added somehow, AO would automatically pick up on that and create new optimized CSS/ JS.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Chris contacted Divi support to get this fixed, so this is in the ticketing queue, but if you&#8217;re using Divi and  encounter slower saving of posts/ pages or Autoptimized files mysteriously disappearing then <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/topic/slow-backend-page-saving/#post-10890400\">his workaround</a> can help you until ET fixes this.</p>\n<div class=\'yarpp-related-rss\'>\n<p>Possibly related twitterless twaddle:<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2016/12/07/wordpress-4-7-custom-background-image-bug-workaround/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"WordPress 4.7 custom background image bug &#038; workaround\">WordPress 4.7 custom background image bug &#038; workaround </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2016/07/24/preparing-for-autoptimize-2-0-3-or-2-1-0/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Preparing (for) Autoptimize 2.0.3 or 2.1.0\">Preparing (for) Autoptimize 2.0.3 or 2.1.0 </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2017/08/11/loading-webfonts-just-for-a-title-switch-to-svg-instead/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Loading webfonts just for a title? Switch to SVG instead.\">Loading webfonts just for a title? Switch to SVG instead. </a></li>\n</ul></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~4/vDzPB14Lhcc\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"/>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:79:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/17/warning-divi-purging-autoptimizes-cache/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2:\"16\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:42:\"http://rssnamespace.org/feedburner/ext/1.0\";a:1:{s:8:\"origLink\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:74:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/17/warning-divi-purging-autoptimizes-cache/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:6;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:57:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\n		\n		\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:6:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:33:\"LYTE YouTube API use warning mail\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~3/hqs8_dKuNjc/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/10/lyte-youtube-api-use/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Sat, 10 Nov 2018 13:19:09 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"lang:en\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"ourTube\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"wp-youtube-lyte\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"mail\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"youtube api\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://blog.futtta.be/?p=10757\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:314:\"WP YouTube Lyte users might have received the following mail from Google/ YouTube: This is to inform you that we noticed your project(s) has not accessed or used the YouTube Data API Service in the past 60 days. Please note, if your project(s) remains inactive for another 30 days from the date of this email [...]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"frank\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3828:\"<p>WP YouTube Lyte users might have received the following mail from Google/ YouTube:</p>\n<blockquote><p>This is to inform you that we noticed your project(s) has not accessed or used the YouTube Data API Service in the past 60 days.</p>\n<p>Please note, if your project(s) remains inactive for another 30 days from the date of this email (November 9, 2018), we will disable your project’s access to, or use of, the YouTube API Data Service. As per Section III(D)(4) of the YouTube API Services Developer Policies (link), YouTube has the right to disable your access to, and use of, the YouTube Data API Service if your project has been inactive for 90 consecutive days.</p></blockquote>\n<p>The reason for this is that LYTE caches the responses from YouTube to ensure optimal performance. You can check your API usage at  <a href=\"https://console.developers.google.com/apis/dashboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://console.developers.google.com/apis/dashboard</a>. In my case it actually was not inactive although not very active either;</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-10758\" src=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before-1024x432.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"625\" height=\"264\" srcset=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before-1024x432.jpg 1024w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before-300x127.jpg 300w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before-624x263.jpg 624w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_before.jpg 1354w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" /></a></p>\n<p>To make sure my API access would not get disabled I ticked the &#8220;Empty WP YouTube Lyte&#8217;s cache&#8221; checkbox in LYTE&#8217;s settings, saved changes to force LYTE to re-request the data from the YT API when pages/ posts with LYTE’s being requested again. The result:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-10759\" src=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after-1024x432.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"625\" height=\"264\" srcset=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after-1024x432.jpg 1024w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after-300x127.jpg 300w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after-624x263.jpg 624w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/yt_api_after.jpg 1354w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" /></a></p>\n<p>I do have a non-neglectable number of videos on this little blog already, but here&#8217;s one more for a rainy Saturday-afternoon;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/10/lyte-youtube-api-use/\"><img src=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/plugins/wp-youtube-lyte/lyteThumbs.php?origThumbUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FZll5Gyp20I0%2Fhqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube Video\"></a><br />Watch this video <a href=\"http://youtu.be/Zll5Gyp20I0\">on YouTube</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\'yarpp-related-rss\'>\n<p>Possibly related twitterless twaddle:<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2010/05/18/lite-youtube-embeds-in-wordpress/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Lite YouTube Embeds in WordPress\">Lite YouTube Embeds in WordPress </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2010/12/31/coding-for-the-new-year/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Coding for the New Year\">Coding for the New Year </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2011/10/11/wp-youtube-lyte-support-for-playlists-almost-included/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"WP YouTube Lyte; support for playlists (almost) included\">WP YouTube Lyte; support for playlists (almost) included </a></li>\n</ul></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~4/hqs8_dKuNjc\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"/>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:60:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/10/lyte-youtube-api-use/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:42:\"http://rssnamespace.org/feedburner/ext/1.0\";a:1:{s:8:\"origLink\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:55:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/11/10/lyte-youtube-api-use/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:7;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:54:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\n		\n		\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:6:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:29:\"Radar, I am (still) under you\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~3/bDNbXeU-3PQ/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:70:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/10/12/radar-i-am-still-under-you/#comments\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Fri, 12 Oct 2018 10:25:09 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:5:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"autoptimize\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"lang:en\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:16:\"100000 downloads\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"crazy numbers\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"not yet\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://blog.futtta.be/?p=10749\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:90:\"So Autoptimize did not go over 100K downloads in one day. Still flying under the radar ;-)\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"frank\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1504:\"<p>So Autoptimize did not go over 100K downloads in one day. Still flying under the radar ;-)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads.png\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10750\" src=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"649\" height=\"205\" srcset=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads.png 649w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads-300x95.png 300w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads-624x197.png 624w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 649px) 100vw, 649px\" /></a></p>\n<div class=\'yarpp-related-rss\'>\n<p>Possibly related twitterless twaddle:<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2013/12/30/autoptimize-no-100000-downloads-just-yet/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Autoptimize: no 100000 downloads just yet\">Autoptimize: no 100000 downloads just yet </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2014/04/17/some-html-dom-parsing-gotchas-in-phps-domdocument/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Some HTML DOM parsing gotchas in PHP&#8217;s DOMDocument\">Some HTML DOM parsing gotchas in PHP&#8217;s DOMDocument </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2016/03/11/clam-av-flagging-css-as-html-exploit-cve_2016_0108/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Clam AV flagging CSS as Html.Exploit.CVE_2016_0108\">Clam AV flagging CSS as Html.Exploit.CVE_2016_0108 </a></li>\n</ul></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~4/bDNbXeU-3PQ\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"/>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:66:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/10/12/radar-i-am-still-under-you/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"3\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:42:\"http://rssnamespace.org/feedburner/ext/1.0\";a:1:{s:8:\"origLink\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:61:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/10/12/radar-i-am-still-under-you/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:8;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\n		\n		\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:6:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:32:\"Autoptimize 2.4 finally released\";s:7:\"attribs\";a: