a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1489:\"<p>So I finally release Autoptimize 2.4, with <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/autoptimize/#developers\">lots of new features and improvements</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/ao24_release.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-10744\" src=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/ao24_release-300x105.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/ao24_release-300x105.jpg 300w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/ao24_release-624x219.jpg 624w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/ao24_release.jpg 726w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n<p>Exited and slightly nervous :-)</p>\n<div class=\'yarpp-related-rss\'>\n<p>Possibly related twitterless twaddle:<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2013/04/18/wp-caching-plugin-vulnerability-debrief/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"WP Caching plugin vulnerability debrief\">WP Caching plugin vulnerability debrief </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2013/12/09/blank-yoast-seo-sitemaps-no-more/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Blank Yoast SEO sitemaps no more!\">Blank Yoast SEO sitemaps no more! </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2014/12/24/autoptimize-minor-update/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Autoptimize minor update and beyond\">Autoptimize minor update and beyond </a></li>\n</ul></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/futtta_wordpress/~4/cGj9HpQvaW8\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"/>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:72:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/09/25/autoptimize-2-4-finally-released/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.o