e/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"649\" height=\"205\" srcset=\"http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads.png 649w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads-300x95.png 300w, http://blog.futtta.be/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ao_downloads-624x197.png 624w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 649px) 100vw, 649px\" /></a></p>\n<div class=\'yarpp-related-rss\'>\n<p>Possibly related twitterless twaddle:<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2013/12/30/autoptimize-no-100000-downloads-just-yet/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Autoptimize: no 100000 downloads just yet\">Autoptimize: no 100000 downloads just yet </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2014/04/17/some-html-dom-parsing-gotchas-in-phps-domdocument/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Some HTML DOM parsing gotchas in PHP&#8217;s DOMDocument\">Some HTML DOM parsing gotchas in PHP&#8217;s DOMDocument </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.futtta.be/2016/03/11/clam-av-flagging-css-as-html-exploit-cve_2016_0108/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Clam AV flagging CSS as Html.Exploit.CVE_2016_0108\">Clam AV flagging CSS as Html.Exploit.CVE_2016_0108 </a></li>\n</ul></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/futtta_autoptimize/~4/bDNbXeU-3PQ\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"/>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:66:\"https://blog.futtta.be/2018/10/12/radar-i-am-still-under-you/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"3\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:42:\"http://rssnamespace.org/feedburner/ext/1.0\";a:1:{s:8:\"origLink\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s