 %s\\n\";i:1707;s:38:\"Please select at least one user role\\n\";i:1708;s:42:\"That field is already added in this form\\n\";i:1709;s:102:\"<pre>Title</pre><pre>Type</pre><pre>Meta Name</pre><pre class=\\\"wppb-mb-head-required\\\">Required</pre>\";i:1710;s:69:\"Use these shortcodes on the pages you want the forms to be displayed:\";i:1711;s:162:\"If you\'re interested in displaying different fields in the registration and edit profile forms, please use the Multiple Registration & Edit Profile Forms Modules.\";i:1712;s:162:\"With Profile Builder Pro you can display different fields in the registration and edit profile forms, using the Multiple Registration & Edit Profile Forms module.\";i:1713;s:15:\"Search Location\";i:1714;s:13:\"Paid Accounts\";i:1715;s:51:\"Paid Member Subscriptions - a free WordPress plugin\";i:1716;s:128:\"With the new Subscriptions Field in Profile Builder, your registration forms will allow your users to sign up for paid accounts.\";i:1717;s:25:\"Paid & Free Subscriptions\";i:1718;s:16:\"Restrict Content\";i:1719;s:17:\"Member Management\";i:1720;s:15:\"Email Templates\";i:1721;s:18:\"Account Management\";i:1722;s:23:\"Subscription Management\";i:1723;s:18:\"Payment Management\";i:1724;s:16:\"Plugin is Active\";i:1725;s:25:\"Plugin has been activated\";i:1726;s:28:\"Plugin has been deactivated.\";i:1727;s:85:\"Accept user payments, create subscription plans and restrict content on your website.\";i:1728;s:24:\"Step by Step Quick Setup\";i:1729;s:116:\"Allow your users to have <strong>paid accounts with Profile Builder</strong>. %1$sFind out how >%2$s %3$sDismiss%4$s\";i:1730;s:24:\"Private Website Settings\";i:1731;s:22:\"Enable Private Website\";i:1732;s:89:\"Activate Private Website. It will restrict the content, RSS and REST API for your website\";i:1733;s:11:\"Redirect to\";i:1734;s:28:\"Default WordPress login page\";i:1735;s:100:\"Redirects to this page if not logged in. We recommend this page contains the [wppb-login] shortcode.\";i:1736;s:99:\"You can force access to wp-login.php so you don\'t get locked out of the site by accessing the link:\";i:1737;s:13:\"Allowed Pages\";i:1738;s:62:\"Allow these pages to be accessed even if you are not logged in\";i:1739;s:14:\"Hide all Menus\";i:1740;s:45:\"Hide all menu items if you are not logged in.\";i:1741;s:147:\"We recommend \\\"<a href=\\\"%s\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Custom Profile Menus</a>\\\" addon if you need different menu items for logged in / logged out users.\";i:1742;s:21:\"Register Your Version\";i:1743;s:16:\"Register Version\";i:1744;s:24:\"Profile Builder Register\";i:1745;s:27:\"Register your version of %s\";i:1746;s:112:\"Now that you acquired a copy of %s, you should take the time and register it with the serial number you received\";i:1747;s:127:\"If you register this version of Profile Builder, you\'ll receive information regarding upgrades, patches, and technical support.\";i:1748;s:15:\" Serial Number:\";i:1749;s:45:\"The serial number was successfully validated!\";i:1750;s:48:\"The serial number entered couldn\'t be validated!\";i:1751;s:42:\"The serial number is about to expire soon!\";i:1752;s:75:\" Your serial number is about to expire, please %1$s Renew Your License%2$s.\";i:1753;s:59:\"The serial number couldn\'t be validated because it expired!\";i:1754;s:67:\" Your serial number is expired, please %1$s Renew Your License%2$s.\";i:1755;s:137:\"The serial number couldn\'t be validated because process timed out. This is possible due to the server being down. Please try again later!\";i:1756;s:50:\"(e.g. RMPB-15-SN-253a55baa4fbe7bf595b2aabb8d72985)\";i:1757;s:217:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> serial number is invalid or missing. <br/>Please %1$sregister your copy%2$s to receive access to automatic updates and support. Need a license key? %3$sPurchase one now%4$s</p>\";i:1758;s:241:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> license has expired. <br/>Please %1$sRenew Your Licence%2$s to continue receiving access to product downloads, automatic updates and support. %3$sRenew now and get 40&#37; off %4$s %5$sDismiss%6$s</p>\";i:1759;s:256:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> license is about to expire on %5$s. <br/>Please %1$sRenew Your Licence%2$s to continue receiving access to product downloads, automatic updates and support. %3$sRenew now and get 40&#37; off %4$s %6$sDismiss%7$s</p>\";i:1760;s:18:\"Strength indicator\";i:1761;s:32:\"Minimum length of %d characters.\";i:1762;s:4:\"here\";i:1763;s:114:\"You will soon be redirected automatically. If you see this page for more than %1$d seconds, please click %2$s.%3$s\";i:1764;s:63:\"No feed available,please visit our <a href=\\\"%s\\\">homepage</a>!\";i:1765;s:32:\"You are not currently logged in.\";i:1766;s:132:\"The role of the created user set to the default role. Only an administrator can register a user with the role assigned to this form.\";i:1767;s:40:\"Only an administrator can add new users.\";i:1768;s:68:\"Users can register themselves or you can manually create users here.\";i:1769;s:46:\"This message is only visible by administrators\";i:1770;s:83:\"Users cannot currently register themselves, but you can manually create users here.\";i:1771;s:24:\"Log out of this account.\";i:1772;s:6:\"Logout\";i:1773;s:43:\"You must be logged in to edit your profile.\";i:1774;s:40:\"There was an error in the submitted form\";i:1775;s:33:\"Send these credentials via email.\";i:1776;s:38:\"The password you entered is incorrect.\";i:1777;s:14:\"Invalid email.\";i:1778;s:26:\"Invalid username or email.\";i:1779;s:17:\"Invalid username.\";i:1780;s:24:\"Password Lost and Found.\";i:1781;s:18:\"Lost your password\";i:1782;s:22:\"Both fields are empty.\";i:1783;s:17:\"Username or Email\";i:1784;s:19:\"Lost your password?\";i:1785;s:7:\"Log out\";i:1786;s:41:\"You are currently logged in as %1$s. %2$s\";i:1787;s:103:\"Your account has to be confirmed by an administrator before you can use the \\\"Password Reset\\\" feature.\";i:1788;s:59:\"You will receive a link to create a new password via email.\";i:1789;s:50:\"The username entered wasn\'t found in the database!\";i:1790;s:51:\"Please check that you entered the correct username.\";i:1791;s:55:\"The email address entered wasn\'t found in the database!\";i:1792;s:56:\"Please check that you entered the correct email address.\";i:1793;s:28:\"Password Reset from \\\"%1$s\\\"\";i:1794;s:48:\"Password Successfully Reset for %1$s on \\\"%2$s\\\"\";i:1795;s:34:\"The entered passwords don\'t match!\";i:1796;s:6:\"ERROR:\";i:1797;s:12:\"Invalid key!\";i:1798;s:23:\"Invalid activation key!\";i:1799;s:28:\"This username is now active!\";i:1800;s:22:\"Could not create user!\";i:1801;s:35:\"This username is already activated!\";i:1802;s:38:\"Your email was successfully confirmed.\";i:1803;s:105:\"Before you can access your account, an administrator needs to approve it. You will be notified via email.\";i:1804;s:53:\"There was an error while trying to activate the user.\";i:1805;s:30:\"Users successfully unapproved!\";i:1806;s:27:\"Users successfully deleted!\";i:1807;s:106:\"Your account has to be confirmed by an administrator before you can use the \\\"Password Recovery\\\" feature.\";i:1808;s:97:\"The approval link is not valid! Please <a href=\\\"%s\\\"> log in </a> to approve the user manually. \";i:1809;s:17:\"delete this user?\";i:1810;s:20:\"unapprove this user?\";i:1811;s:18:\"approve this user?\";i:1812;s:100:\"Checking only \\\"Logged In Users\\\" will show this %s to all logged in users, regardless of user role.\";i:1813;s:24:\"If you select \\\"Message\\\";i:1814;s:25:\"If you select \\\"Redirect\\\";i:1815;s:45:\"Show the first %s words of the post\'s content\";i:1816;s:40:\"Show the content before the \\\"more\\\" tag\";i:1817;s:20:\"[%1$s] Activate %2$s\";i:1818;s:152:\"To activate your user, please click the following link:<br><br>%s%s%s<br><br>After you activate it you will receive yet *another email* with your login.\";i:1819;s:35:\"That username is already activated!\";i:1820;s:52:\"There was an error while trying to activate the user\";i:1821;s:39:\"A new subscriber has (been) registered!\";i:1822;s:67:\"New subscriber on %1$s.<br/><br/>Username:%2$s<br/>E-mail:%3$s<br/>\";i:1823;s:35:\"[%1$s] Your new account information\";i:1824;s:32:\"Your selected password at signup\";i:1825;s:135:\"Welcome to %1$s!<br/><br/><br/>Your username is:%2$s and the password you selected on registration.<br/><br/>Access your account: %3$s \";i:1826;s:112:\"Welcome to %1$s!<br/><br/><br/>Your username is:%2$s and the password: %3$s.<br/><br/>Access your account: %4$s \";i:1827;s:153:\"The \\\"Admin Approval\\\" feature was activated at the time of registration, so please remember that you need to approve this user before he/she can log in!\";i:1828;s:10:\"Capability\";i:1829;s:48:\"You can\'t delete this capability from your role.\";i:1830;s:12:\"Add New Role\";i:1831;s:9:\"Edit Role\";i:1832;s:8:\"New Role\";i:1833;s:9:\"View Role\";i:1834;s:23:\"Search the Roles Editor\";i:1835;s:14:\"No roles found\";i:1836;s:23:\"No roles found in trash\";i:1837;s:13:\"Role updated.\";i:1838;s:21:\"Custom field updated.\";i:1839;s:21:\"Custom field deleted.\";i:1840;s:13:\"Role created.\";i:1841;s:11:\"Role saved.\";i:1842;s:15:\"Role submitted.\";i:1843;s:41:\"Role scheduled for: <strong>%1$s</strong>\";i:1844;s:19:\"Role draft updated.\";i:1845;s:9:\"Role Name\";i:1846;s:9:\"Role Slug\";i:1847;s:12:\"Capabilities\";i:1848;s:5:\"Users\";i:1849;s:5:\"Clone\";i:1850;s:27:\"You can\'t delete your role.\";i:1851;s:14:\"Change Default\";i:1852;s:51:\"You can\'t delete the default role. Change it first.\";i:1853;s:15:\"Edit User Roles\";i:1854;s:11:\"After Login\";i:1855;s:12:\"After Logout\";i:1856;s:18:\"After Registration\";i:1857;s:18:\"After Edit Profile\";i:1858;s:35:\"After Successful Email Confirmation\";i:1859;s:31:\"After Successful Password Reset\";i:1860;s:55:\"Dashboard (redirect users from accessing the dashboard)\";i: