g)\";i:1940;s:50:\"Set the avatar size on the single-userlisting only\";i:1941;s:32:\"Visible only to logged in users?\";i:1942;s:64:\"The userlisting will only be visible only to the logged in users\";i:1943;s:26:\"Visible to following Roles\";i:1944;s:59:\"The userlisting will only be visible to the following roles\";i:1945;s:20:\"Userlisting Settings\";i:1946;s:50:\"Choose the facet name that appears on the frontend\";i:1947;s:10:\"Facet Type\";i:1948;s:26:\"Choose the facet menu type\";i:1949;s:10:\"Facet Meta\";i:1950;s:40:\"Choose the meta field for the facet menu\";i:1951;s:9:\"Behaviour\";i:1952;s:18:\"Narrow the results\";i:1953;s:18:\"Expand the results\";i:1954;s:49:\"Choose how multiple selections affect the results\";i:1955;s:15:\"Visible choices\";i:1956;s:63:\"Show a toggle link after this many choices. Leave blank for all\";i:1957;s:56:\"Choose the fields in which the Search Field will look in\";i:1958;s:15:\"Search Settings\";i:1959;s:77:\"You need to activate the Userlisting feature from within the \\\"Modules\\\" tab!\";i:1960;s:44:\"You can find it in the Profile Builder menu.\";i:1961;s:17:\"No results found!\";i:1962;s:34:\"Yes, I\'d like to create a new site\";i:1963;s:13:\"Site URL slug\";i:1964;s:10:\"Site Title\";i:1965;s:102:\"Privacy: I would like my site to appear in search engines, and in public listings around this network.\";i:1966;s:51:\"The email you entered is not a valid email address.\";i:1967;s:37:\"You must enter a valid email address.\";i:1968;s:47:\"This email is already reserved to be used soon.\";i:1969;s:27:\"Please try a different one!\";i:1970;s:29:\"This email is already in use.\";i:1971;s:26:\"The passwords do not match\";i:1972;s:45:\"To use reCAPTCHA you must get an API key from\";i:1973;s:63:\"For security reasons, you must pass the remote ip to reCAPTCHA!\";i:1974;s:53:\"To use reCAPTCHA you must get an API public key from:\";i:1975;s:53:\"Click the BACK button on your browser, and try again.\";i:1976;s:61:\"Only a