2011;s:34:\"\"Email Confirmation\" Landing Page:\";i:2012;s:27:\"\"Admin Approval\" Activated:\";i:2013;s:30:\"\"Admin Approval\" on User Role:\";i:2014;s:25:\"\"Roles Editor\" Activated:\";i:2015;s:25:\"\"Admin Approval\" Feature:\";i:2016;s:69:\"\"Username and Email\" - users can Log In with both Username and Email.\";i:2017;s:49:\"\"Username\" - users can Log In only with Username.\";i:2018;s:43:\"\"Email\" - users can Log In only with Email.\";i:2019;s:100:\"You can force access to wp-login.php so you don\\\'t get locked out of the site by accessing the link:\";i:2020;s:141:\"We recommend \"<a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Profile Menus</a>\" addon if you need different menu items for logged in / logged out users.\";i:2021;s:8:\"Standard\";i:2022;s:8:\"Advanced\";i:2023;s:79:\". Extra Field Types are available in <a href=\"%s\">Hobbyist or PRO versions</a>.\";i:2024;s:182:\"Enter a detailed description of the temrs of agreement for the user to read.<br/>Links can be inserted by using standard HTML syntax: &lt;a href=\"custom_url\"&gt;custom_text&lt;/a&gt;\";i:2025;s:142:\"Choose the <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/docs/versions\" target=\"_blank\">type of reCAPTCHA</a> you wish to add to this site.\";i:2026;s:112:\"The site key from Google, <a href=\"http://www.google.com/recaptcha\" target=\"_blank\">www.google.com/recaptcha</a>\";i:2027;s:114:\"The secret key from Google, <a href=\"http://www.google.com/recaptcha\" target=\"_blank\">www.google.com/recaptcha</a>\";i:2028;s:258:\"Enter your Google Maps API key ( <a href=\"https://console.developers.google.com/flows/enableapi?apiid=maps_backend\" target=\"_blank\">Get your API key</a> ). If more than one map fields are added to a form the API key from the first map displayed will be used.\";i:2029;s:13:\"Aruba Guilder\";i:2030;s:100:\"<pre>Title</pre><pre>Type</pre><pre>Meta Name</pre><pre class=\"wppb-mb-head-required\">Required</pre>\";i:2031;s:12:\"More Details\";i:2032;s:192:\"If you enjoy using <strong> %1$s </strong> please <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">rate us on WordPress.org</a>. More happy users means more features, less bugs and better support for everyone. \";i:2033;s:13:\"Contact Forms\";i:2034;s:12:\"Contact Form\";i:2035;s:8:\"Untitled\";i:2036;s:46:\"https://contactform7.com/configuration-errors/\";i:2037;s:32:\"There is a possible empty field.\";i:2038;s:31:\"Invalid mailbox syntax is used.\";i:2039;s:56:\"Sender email address does not belong to the site domain.\";i:2040;s:32:\"HTML tags are used in a message.\";i:2041;s:53:\"Multiple form controls are in a single label element.\";i:2042;s:37:\"There are invalid mail header fields.\";i:2043;s:29:\"Deprecated settings are used.\";i:2044;s:10:\"(required)\";i:2045;s:9:\"Your Name\";i:2046;s:10:\"Your Email\";i:2047;s:7:\"Subject\";i:2048;s:12:\"Your Message\";i:2049;s:4:\"Send\";i:2050;s:8:\"From: %s\";i:2051;s:11:\"Subject: %s\";i:2052;s:13:\"Message Body:\";i:2053;s:55:\"This e-mail was sent from a contact form on %1$s (%2$s)\";i:2054;s:38:\"Sender\'s message was sent successfully\";i:2055;s:45:\"Thank you for your message. It has been sent.\";i:2056;s:31:\"Sender\'s message failed to send\";i:2057;s:71:\"There was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\";i:2058;s:26:\"Validation errors occurred\";i:2059;s:61:\"One or more fields have an error. Please check and try again.\";i:2060;s:34:\"Submission was referred to as spam\";i:2061;s:43:\"There are terms that the sender must accept\";i:2062;s:69:\"You must accept the terms and conditions before sending your message.\";i:2063;s:45:\"There is a field that the sender must fill in\";i:2064;s:22:\"The field is required.\";i:2065;s:74:\"There is a field with input that is longer than the maximum allowed length\";i:2066;s:22:\"The field is too long.\";i:2067;s:75:\"There is a field with input that is shorter than the minimum allowed length\";i:2068;s:23:\"The field is too short.\";i:2069;s:51:\"Sender doesn\'t enter the correct answer to the quiz\";i:2070;s:36:\"The answer to the quiz is incorrect.\";i:2071;s:4:\"quiz\";i:2072;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for a question-answer pair. For more details, see %s.\";i:2073;s:30:\"https://contactform7.com/quiz/\";i:2074;s:4:\"Quiz\";i:2075;s:21:\"Questions and answers\";i:2076;s:83:\"One pipe-separated question-answer pair (e.g. The capital of Brazil?|Rio) per line.\";i:2077;s:12:\"Id attribute\";i:2078;s:15:\"Class attribute\";i:2079;s:10:\"Insert Tag\";i:2080;s:46:\"Date format that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2081;s:29:\"The date format is incorrect.\";i:2082;s:34:\"Date is earlier than minimum limit\";i:2083;s:44:\"The date is before the earliest one allowed.\";i:2084;s:32:\"Date is later than maximum limit\";i:2085;s:41:\"The date is after the latest one allowed.\";i:2086;s:4:\"date\";i:2087;s:69:\"Generate a form-tag for a date input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2088;s:36:\"https://contactform7.com/date-field/\";i:2089;s:10:\"Date Field\";i:2090;s:10:\"Field type\";i:2091;s:14:\"Required field\";i:2092;s:13:\"Default value\";i:2093;s:45:\"Use this text as the placeholder of the field\";i:2094;s:141:\"To use the value input through this field in a mail field, you need to insert the corresponding mail-tag (%s) into the field on the Mail tab.\";i:2095;s:7:\"CAPTCHA\";i:2096;s:187:\"API keys for reCAPTCHA v3 are different from those for v2; keys for v2 don&#8217;t work with the v3 API. You need to register your sites again to get new keys for v3. For details, see %s.\";i:2097;s:35:\"https://contactform7.com/recaptcha/\";i:2098;s:14:\"reCAPTCHA (v3)\";i:2099;s:19:\"Invalid key values.\";i:2100;s:15:\"Settings saved.\";i:2101;s:203:\"reCAPTCHA protects you against spam and other types of automated abuse. With Contact Form 7&#8217;s reCAPTCHA integration module, you can block abusive form submissions by spam bots. For details, see %s.\";i:2102;s:17:\"Setup Integration\";i:2103;s:37:\"Uploading a file fails for any reason\";i:2104;s:46:\"There was an unknown error uploading the file.\";i:2105;s:42:\"Uploaded file is not allowed for file type\";i:2106;s:49:\"You are not allowed to upload files of this type.\";i:2107;s:26:\"Uploaded file is too large\";i:2108;s:20:\"The file is too big.\";i:2109;s:36:\"Uploading a file fails for PHP error\";i:2110;s:38:\"There was an error uploading the file.\";i:2111;s:4:\"file\";i:2112;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for a file uploading field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2113;s:55:\"https://contactform7.com/file-uploading-and-attachment/\";i:2114;s:29:\"File Uploading and Attachment\";i:2115;s:23:\"File size limit (bytes)\";i:2116;s:21:\"Acceptable file types\";i:2117;s:155:\"To attach the file uploaded through this field to mail, you need to insert the corresponding mail-tag (%s) into the File Attachments field on the Mail tab.\";i:2118;s:189:\"This contact form contains file uploading fields, but the temporary folder for the files (%s) does not exist or is not writable. You can create the folder or change its permission manually.\";i:2119;s:6:\"submit\";i:2120;s:66:\"Generate a form-tag for a submit button. For more details, see %s.\";i:2121;s:39:\"https://contactform7.com/submit-button/\";i:2122;s:13:\"Submit Button\";i:2123;s:9:\"Consented\";i:2124;s:13:\"Not consented\";i:2125;s:10:\"acceptance\";i:2126;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for an acceptance checkbox. For more details, see %s.\";i:2127;s:45:\"https://contactform7.com/acceptance-checkbox/\";i:2128;s:19:\"Acceptance Checkbox\";i:2129;s:9:\"Condition\";i:2130;s:27:\"Make this checkbox optional\";i:2131;s:45:\"To use CAPTCHA, you need %s plugin installed.\";i:2132;s:55:\"The code that sender entered does not match the CAPTCHA\";i:2133;s:31:\"Your entered code is incorrect.\";i:2134;s:31:\"CAPTCHA (Really Simple CAPTCHA)\";i:2135;s:65:\"To use CAPTCHA, you first need to install and activate %s plugin.\";i:2136;s:104:\"Generate form-tags for a CAPTCHA image and corresponding response input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2137;s:33:\"https://contactform7.com/captcha/\";i:2138;s:14:\"Image settings\";i:2139;s:20:\"Input field settings\";i:2140;s:182:\"This contact form contains CAPTCHA fields, but the temporary folder for the files (%s) does not exist or is not writable. You can create the folder or change its permission manually.\";i:2141;s:122:\"This contact form contains CAPTCHA fields, but the necessary libraries (GD and FreeType) are not available on your server.\";i:2142;s:9:\"text area\";i:2143;s:80:\"Generate a form-tag for a multi-line text input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2144;s:37:\"https://contactform7.com/text-fields/\";i:2145;s:11:\"Text Fields\";i:2146;s:10:\"checkboxes\";i:2147;s:13:\"radio buttons\";i:2148;s:72:\"Generate a form-tag for a group of checkboxes. For more details, see %s.\";i:2149;s:75:\"Generate a form-tag for a group of radio buttons. For more details, see %s.\";i:2150;s:60:\"https://contactform7.com/checkboxes-radio-buttons-and-menus/\";i:2151;s:35:\"Checkboxes, Radio Buttons and Menus\";i:2152;s:20:\"One option per line.\";i:2153;s:34:\"Put a label first, a checkbox last\";i:2154;s:33:\"Wrap each item with label element\";i:2155;s:25:\"Make checkboxes exclusive\";i:2156;s:48:\"Email address that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2157;s:38:\"The e-mail address entered is invalid.\";i:2158;s:38:\"URL that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2159;s:19:\"The URL is invalid.\";i:2160;s:51:\"Telephone number that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2161;s:32:\"The telephone number is invalid.\";i:2162;s:4:\"text\";i:2163;s:5:\"email\";i:2164;s:3:\"tel\";i:2165;s:87:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line plain text input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2166;s:90:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line email address input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2167;s:80:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line URL input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2168;s:93:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line telephone number input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2169;s:7:\"Akismet\";i:2170;s:33:\"This field requires author\'s name\";i:2171;s:42:\"This field requires author\'s email address\";i:2172;s:32:\"This field requires author\'s URL\";i:2173;s:15:\"Email Marketing\";i:2174;s:16:\"Constant Contact\";i:2175;s:231:\"The Constant Contact integration module allows you to send contact data collected through your contact forms to the Constant Contact API. You can create reliable email subscription services in a few easy steps. For details, see %s.\";i:2176;s:54:\"https://contactform7.com/constant-contact-integration/\";i:2177;s:28:\"Constant Contact Integration\";i:2178;s:7:\"API Key\";i:2179;s:10:\"App Secret\";i:2180;s:12:\"Redirect URI\";i:2181;s:33:\"Set this URL as the redirect URI.\";i:2182;s:35:\"Connect to the Constant Contact API\";i:2183;s:48:\"Number format that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2184;s:29:\"The number format is invalid.\";i:2185;s:36:\"Number is smaller than minimum limit\";i:2186;s:47:\"The number is smaller than the minimum allowed.\";i:2187;s:35:\"Number is larger than maximum limit\";i:2188;s:46:\"The number is larger than the maximum allowed.\";i:2189;s:6:\"number\";i:2190;s:82:\"Generate a form-tag for a field for numeric value input. For more details, see %s.\";i:2191;s:39:\"https://contactform7.com/number-fields/\";i:2192;s:13:\"Number Fields\";i:2193;s:7:\"Spinbox\";i:2194;s:6:\"Slider\";i:2195;s:14:\"drop-down menu\";i:2196;s:67:\"Generate a form-tag for a drop-down menu. For more details, see %s.\";i:2197;s:25:\"Allow multiple selections\";i:2198;s:39:\"Insert a blank item as the first option\";i:2199;s:8:\"Overview\";i:2200;s:17:\"Available Actions\";i:2201;s:9:\"Form-tags\";i:2202;s:9:\"Mail-tags\";i:2203;s:305:\"On this screen, you can manage contact forms provided by Contact Form 7. You can manage an unlimited number of contact forms. Each contact form has a unique ID and Contact Form 7 shortcode ([contact-form-7 ...]). To insert a contact form into a post or a text widget, insert the shortcode into the target.\";i:2204;s:154:\"Hovering over a row in the contact forms list will display action links that allow you to manage your contact form. You can perform the following actions:\";i:2205;s:148:\"<strong>Edit</strong> - Navigates to the editing screen for that contact form. You can also reach that screen by clicking on the contact form title.\";i:2206;s:140:\"<strong>Duplicate</strong> - Clones that contact form. A cloned contact form inherits all content from the original, but has a different ID.\";i:2207;s:101:\"On this screen, you can edit a contact form. A contact form is comprised of the following components:\";i:2208;s:126:\"<strong>Title</strong> is the title of a contact form. This title is only used for labeling a contact form, and can be edited.\";i:2209;s:172:\"<strong>Form</strong> is a content of HTML form. You can use arbitrary HTML, which is allowed inside a form element. You can also use Contact Form 7&#8217;s form-tags here.\";i:2210;s:178:\"<strong>Mail</strong> manages a mail template (headers and message body) that this contact form will send when users submit it. You can use Contact Form 7&#8217;s mail-tags here.\";i:2211;s:168:\"<strong>Mail (2)</strong> is an additional mail template that works similar to Mail. Mail (2) is different in that it is sent only when Mail has been sent successfully.\";i:2212;s:221:\"In <strong>Messages</strong>, you can edit various types of messages used for this contact form. These messages are relatively short messages, like a validation error message you see when you leave a required field blank.\";i:2213;s:136:\"<strong>Additional Settings</strong> provides a place where you can customize the behavior of this contact form by adding code snippets.\";i:2214;s:398:\"A form-tag is a short code enclosed in square brackets used in a form content. A form-tag generally represents an input field, and its components can be separated into four parts: type, name, options, and values. Contact Form 7 supports several types of form-tags including text fields, number fields, date fields, checkboxes, radio buttons, menus, file-uploading fields, CAPTCHAs, and quiz fields.\";i:2215;s:218:\"While form-tags have a comparatively complex syntax, you don&#8217;t need to know the syntax to add form-tags because you can use the straightforward tag generator (<strong>Generate Tag</strong> button on this screen).\";i:2216;s:203:\"A mail-tag is also a short code enclosed in square brackets that you can use in every Mail and Mail (2) field. A mail-tag represents a user input value through an input field of a corresponding form-tag.\";i:2217;s:230:\"There are also special mail-tags that have specific names, but don&#8217;t have corresponding form-tags. They are used to represent meta information of form submissions like the submitter&#8217;s IP address or the URL of the page.\";i:2218;s:160:\"On this screen, you can manage services that are available through Contact Form 7. Using API will allow you to collaborate with any services that are available.\";i:2219;s:183:\"You may need to first sign up for an account with the service that you plan to use. When you do so, you would need to authorize Contact Form 7 to access the service with your account.\";i:2220;s:97:\"Any information you provide will not be shared with service providers without your authorization.\";i:2221;s:21:\"For more information:\";i:2222;s:30:\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\";i:2223;s:29:\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\";i:2224;s:3:\"FAQ\";i:2225;s:33:\"https://contactform7.com/support/\";i:2226;s:7:\"Dismiss\";i:2227;s:37:\"Getting spammed? You have protection.\";i:2228;s:186:\"Spammers target everything; your contact forms aren&#8217;t an exception. Before you get spammed, protect your contact forms with the powerful anti-spam features Contact Form 7 provides.\";i:2229;s:206:\"Contact Form 7 supports spam-filtering with %1$s. Intelligent %2$s blocks annoying spambots. Plus, using %3$s, you can block messages containing specified keywords or those sent from specified IP addresses.\";i:2230;s:53:\"https://contactform7.com/spam-filtering-with-akismet/\";i:2231;s:43:\"https://contactform7.com/comment-blacklist/\";i:2232;s:17:\"comment blacklist\";i:2233;s:34:\"Contact Form 7 needs your support.\";i:2234;s:105:\"It is hard to continue development and support for this plugin without contributions from users like you.\";i:2235;s:73:\"If you enjoy using Contact Form 7 and find it useful, please consider %s.\";i:2236;s:32:\"https://contactform7.com/donate/\";i:2237;s:17:\"making a donation\";i:2238;s:111:\"Your donation will help encourage and support the plugin&#8217;s continued development and better user support.\";i:2239;s:37:\"Before you cry over spilt mail&#8230;\";i:2240;s:190:\"Contact Form 7 doesn&#8217;t store submitted messages anywhere. Therefore, you may lose important messages forever if your mail server has issues or you make a mistake in mail configuration.\";i:2241;s:205:\"Install a message storage plugin before this happens to you. %s saves all messages through contact forms into the database. Flamingo is a free WordPress plugin created by the same author as Contact Form 7.\";i:2242;s:63:\"https://contactform7.com/save-submitted-messages-with-flamingo/\";i:2243;s:8:\"Flamingo\";i:2244;s:37:\"Validate Contact Form 7 Configuration\";i:2245;s:99:\"Misconfiguration leads to mail delivery failure or other troubles. Validate your contact forms now.\";i:2246;s:46:\"You are not allowed to validate configuration.\";i:2247;s:22:\"Validate Configuration\";i:2248;s:53:\"https://contactform7.com/configuration-validator-faq/\";i:2249;s:33:\"FAQ about Configuration Validator\";i:2250;s:4:\"Date\";i:2251;s:21:\"Edit &#8220;%s&#8221;\";i:2252;s:13:\"Y/m/d g:i:s A\";i:2253;s:6:\"%s ago\";i:2254;s:5:\"Y/m/d\";i:2255;s:47:\"https://contactform7.com/editing-form-template/\";i:2256;s:21:\"Editing Form Template\";i:2257;s:57:\"You can edit the form template here. For details, see %s.\";i:2258;s:4:\"Form\";i:2259;s:8:\"Mail (2)\";i:2260;s:12:\"Use Mail (2)\";i:2261;s:4:\"Mail\";i:2262;s:71:\"Mail (2) is an additional mail template often used as an autoresponder.\";i:2263;s:41:\"https://contactform7.com/setting-up-mail/\";i:2264;s:15:\"Setting Up Mail\";i:2265;s:57:\"You can edit the mail template here. For details, see %s.\";i:2266;s:53:\"In the following fields, you can use these mail-tags:\";i:2267;s:2:\"To\";i:2268;s:4:\"From\";i:2269;s:18:\"Additional Headers\";i:2270;s:12:\"Message Body\";i:2271;s:46:\"Exclude lines with blank mail-tags from output\";i:2272;s:21:\"Use HTML content type\";i:2273;s:16:\"File Attachments\";i:2274;s:42:\"https://contactform7.com/editing-messages/\";i:2275;s:16:\"Editing Messages\";i:2276;s:75:\"You can edit messages used in various situations here. For details, see %s.\";i:2277;s:8:\"Messages\";i:2278;s:45:\"https://contactform7.com/additional-settings/\";i:2279;s:19:\"Additional Settings\";i:2280;s:66:\"You can add customization code snippets here. For details, see %s.\";i:2281;s:20:\"Add New Contact Form\";i:2282;s:17:\"Edit Contact Form\";i:2283;s:16:\"Enter title here\";i:2284;s:78:\"Copy this shortcode and paste it into your post, page, or text widget content:\";i:2285;s:42:\"You can also use this old-style shortcode:\";i:2286;s:79:\"You are about to delete this contact form.\\n  \'Cancel\' to stop, \'OK\' to delete.\";i:2287;s:17:\"Do you need help?\";i:2288;s:60:\"Here are some available options to help solve your problems.\";i:2289;s:15:\"%1$s &#38; %2$s\";i:2290;s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\";i:2291;s:14:\"Support Forums\";i:2292;s:44:\"https://contactform7.com/custom-development/\";i:2293;s:21:\"Professional Services\";i:2294;s:28:\"%1$s %2$s keys switch panels\";i:2295;s:22:\"(left and right arrow)\";i:2296;s:24:\"Additional Settings (%d)\";i:2297;s:14:\"Contact Form 7\";i:2298;s:7:\"Contact\";i:2299;s:31:\"Integration with Other Services\";i:2300;s:11:\"Integration\";i:2301;s:70:\"The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page.\";i:2302;s:15:\"How to resolve?\";i:2303;s:30:\"1 configuration error detected\";i:2304;s:32:\"%d configuration errors detected\";i:2305;s:48:\"1 configuration error detected in this tab panel\";i:2306;s:50:\"%d configuration errors detected in this tab panel\";i:2307;s:21:\"(configuration error)\";i:2308;s:38:\"You are not allowed to edit this item.\";i:2309;s:40:\"You are not allowed to delete this item.\";i:2310;s:18:\"Error in deleting.\";i:2311;s:35:\"Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;\";i:2312;s:20:\"Search Contact Forms\";i:2313;s:21:\"Contact form created.\";i:2314;s:19:\"Contact form saved.\";i:2315;s:21:\"Contact form deleted.\";i:2316;s:43:\"There was an error saving the contact form.\";i:2317;s:70:\"Configuration validation completed. No invalid contact form was found.\";i:2318;s:121:\"<strong>Contact Form 7 %1$s requires WordPress %2$s or higher.</strong> Please <a href=\"%3$s\">update WordPress</a> first.\";i:2319;s:46:\"You are not allowed to edit this contact form.\";i:2320;s:113:\"Import <strong>posts, pages, comments, custom fields, categories, and tags</strong> from a WordPress export file.\";i:2321;s:6:\"Manage\";i:2322;s:26:\"Content Type Configuration\";i:2323;s:20:\"Translation Profiles\";i:2324;s:13:\"String Groups\";i:2325;s:7:\"Strings\";i:2326;s:1090:\"\n					\n								<div class=\'Youve-Selected-Prof\'>You\'ve Selected Professional Translation</div><br>\n								\n								<div class=\'By-Selecting-this-op\'>\n									By selecting this option as your workflow you will be able to request professional translations through Lingotek’s Languages Services. \n									Please click the \\\"ADD PAYMENT METHOD\\\" button to use this service.\n								</div><br><br><br>\n\n								<div class=\'Note-By-using-the-\'>\n									Note: By using the \'Lingotek Professional Translation\' workflow you will be asked to confirm payment before the professional translation request is processed. \n								</div>\n\n									<button type=\'button\' id=\'no-\" . esc_attr( $this->workflow_id ) . \"\' class=\'background-test float-bottom-right-next-to-default\'>\n										<span class=\'ADD-PAYMENT-LATER\'>LATER</span>\n									</button>\n									<button type=\'button\' id=\'yes-\" . esc_attr( $this->workflow_id ) . \"\' class=\'prefessional-action-button-default float-bottom-right\'>\n  										<span class=\'ADD-PAYMENT\'>ADD PAYMENT METHOD</span>\n									</button>\n								</div>\n\n								\";i:2327;s:23:\"Confirm Document Upload\";i:2328;s:1800:\"\n				<div id=\'warning-wrapper\'>\n					<div class=\'professional-upload-warning-header-container\'>\n						<span class=\'professional-upload-warning-header\'>By uploading these changes, your professional translations may be lost.</span>\n					</div>\n\n					<div class=\'professional-upload-warning-body-container\'>\n						<span class=\'professional-upload-warning-body\'>\n							By editing this document and then re-uploading it to Lingotek any professional translations that you have not downloaded yet will be lost. Additionally, any professional translations that are in-progress for this document will be lost.\n						</span>\n					</div>\n\n					<div class=\'professional-warning-checkbox-container\'><input id=\'professional-warning-checkbox\' type=\'checkbox\' name=\'confirm-request\' value=\'professional-warning-upload></div>\n					<div class=\'professional-warning-checkbox-text-container\'><span class=\'professional-warning-checkbox-text\'> I understand that translations that have not been downloaded or that are in progress will be lost and money paid for that translation will be forfeited by re-uploading them to Lingotek.</span></div>\n					\n					<button type=\'button\' id=\'cancel-warning-\" . esc_attr( $id ) . \"\' class=\'professional-cancel-button float-bottom-right-next-to\'>\n						<span class=\'ADD-PAYMENT-LATER\'>CANCEL</span>\n					</button>\n					<div class=\'float-bottom-right\' style=\'bottom:5%;\'><img id=\'professional-warning-loading-spinner\' style=\'display:none;\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/loading_mini.gif\' /></div>\n					<button type=\'button\' id=\'ok-warning-\" . esc_attr( $id ) . \"\' class=\'professional-okay-warning-button-disabled float-bottom-right\' disabled=\'true\'>\n						<span id=\'professional-warning-okay-text\' class=\'ADD-PAYMENT-DISABLED\'>PROCEED</span>\n					</button>\n				\n				</div>\";i:2329;s:27:\"Confirm Request Translation\";i:2330;s:10523:\"\n							<div id=\'wrapper\'>\n								<div id=\'content\'><br>\n									<div id=\'professional-table-content\'>\n										<span class=\'Congratulations-You payment-method-setup\'>You have elected to use our Professional Translation Services.<br><br></span>\n										<div class=\'You-can-now-connect payment-method-setup\'>\n											You can now connect with audiences around the globe using Lingotek\'s network of 5000+ professional, in-country, translators. Professional Translation ensures that your audiences will feel the sentiment of your content.\n										</div>\n										\n										<span class=\'Congratulations-You payment-not-setup\'>Welcome to Lingotek\'s Translation Quote Calculator<br><br></span>\n										<div class=\'You-can-now-connect payment-not-setup\'>\n											Using the quote calculator below you can get an idea of how much your translations will cost. You will need to add a payment method to the Lingotek Secure Payment Portal In order to purchase these translations.\n										</div>\n										<br>\n										<div class=\'minimum-per-language-warning minimum-warning\'>\n											<img  src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/minimum-warning.svg\' />\n											<span >*$59.99 minimum per language.</span>\n											<span  ltk-data-tooltip=\'This minimum ensures that we can retain the best professional linguists for your translation job.\'><img src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/minimum-help.svg\' /></span>\n										</div>\n										<br class=\'payment-not-setup\'>\n										<span class=\'Translation-Request payment-not-setup\'>Translation Quotes<br><br></span>\n										<br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n										<span class=\'Translation-Request payment-method-setup\'>Translation Request Summary<br><br></span>\n										<div id=\'table-wrapper\'>\n											<table class=\'request-table\'>\n													<tr class=\'bordered-bottom\'><th style=\'display: table-cell;\' class=\'table-header\'>Title</th><th style=\'display: table-cell;\' class=\'table-header\' id=\'words-column\'>Words</th><th style=\'text-align:center;\'><a href=\'#\' id=\'next-language-set\'> <img id=\'next-language-image\' src=\'\" . esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) . \"/img/right-arrow.svg\' /> </a> </th><th class=\'table-header table-total invisible\'>Total</th></tr>\n											</table>\n										</div>\n									</div>\n									<div id=\'professional-terms-and-conditions\'>\n										<span class=\'terms-and-conditions-header\'>Lingotek Terms and Conditions</span><br><br>\n										<div class=\'terms-and-conditions-content\'>\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										<img id=\'terms-of-service-loading-ltk\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) .\"/img/loading.gif\'/>\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										\n										</div>\n										<button type=\'button\' id=\'close-terms-and-conditions\'>\n											<span class=\'CLOSE-TERMS-CONDITIONS\'>CLOSE</span>\n										</button>\n									</div>\n								</div>\n								<div id=\'sidebar\'>\n									<span class=\'Payment-Method payment-method-setup\'>Payment Method</span><br class=\'payment-method-setup\'><br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n									<span class=\'payment-method-setup credit-card-header\'>Credit Card</span><br class=\'payment-method-setup\'><br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n									<div class=\'payment-method-setup professional-card-border\'>\n										<div class=\'payment-method-setup blue-radio-button-div\'><img id=\'blue-radio-button\' class=\'payment-method-setup\' src=\'\" . esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  . \"/img/blue-radio-button.svg\'/></div>\n										<div class=\'payment-method-setup credit-card-dots-div\'><img id=\'credit-card-dots\' class=\'payment-method-setup\' src=\'\" . esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) . \"/img/credit-dots.svg\'/></div>\n										<div class=\'payment-method-setup last-four-digits-div\'><span id=\'last-four-digits\' class=\'payment-method-setup\'>XXXX</span></div>\n										<div class=\'payment-method-setup credit-card-image-div\'><img id=\'credit-card-image\' class=\'payment-method-setup\' src=\'\" . Lingotek_Credit_Card_To_Path::get_cc_type_asset_url( Lingotek_Credit_Card_To_Path::get_default_cc_key() ) . \"\'/></div>\n									</div>\n									<br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n									<br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n\n\n									<span class=\'Payment-Method payment-not-setup\'>Benefits of Professional Translation</span><br class=\'payment-not-setup\'>\n									<ul class=\'translation-summary-list payment-not-setup\'>\n										<li><span class=\'translation-summary-list-text\'>Translations will be translated by professional in-country linguists.</span></li>\n										<li><span class=\'translation-summary-list-text\'>Receive your translations in just a few days.</span></li>\n										<li><span class=\'translation-summary-list-text\'>100% customer satisfaction guarantee.</span></li>\n									</ul>\n									<br class=\'payment-not-setup\'>\n									<span class=\'Translation-Request-Right payment-method-setup\'>Translation Request Summary</span>\n									<span class=\'Translation-Request-Right payment-not-setup\'>Translation Quote Summary</span>\n									<ul class=\'translation-summary-list translation-summary-list-ltk\'>\n										\n									</ul>\n									<div class=\'minimum-disclaimer\'>*Minimum charge $59.99 per language</div>\n									<br>\n									<div style=\'float:right;\'>\n										<span class=\'request-total\'>TOTAL: </span><span class=\'lingotek-total-amount\'></span>\n									</div>\n\n									<div class=\'ltk-request-payment-disclaimer payment-method-setup\'>\n									Note: By clicking the \'Buy Now\' button your translations will be requested and you will be charged for the amount shown above.\n									</div>\n									\n									\n									<br class=\'payment-not-setup\'><br class=\'payment-not-setup\'><br class=\'payment-not-setup\'>\n									<div class=\'disclaimer-request payment-not-setup\'>\n										Note: By clicking the \'Add Payment Method\' button you will be redirected to the Lingotek Secure Payment Portal.\n										Please note that none of the selections you have made in the table will be saved.\n									</div>\n									<br class=\'payment-method-setup\'><br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n\n									<div class=\'delivery-estimation\'>Estimated delivery: <span class=\'business-days\'>3 - 5 business days.</span><span ltk-data-tooltip=\'This is an estimate, not a guaranteed delivery time.\'><img src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/minimum-help.svg\' /></span></div>\n									<div class=\'request-checkbox payment-method-setup\'><input id=\'accept-terms-and-conditions-input\' type=\'checkbox\' name=\'confirm-request\' value=\'request-translation><span class=\'terms-conditions\'> I agree to the <a id=\'terms-and-conditions-href\' href=\'#\'>Lingotek Terms and Conditions</a></span></div>\n									<br class=\'payment-method-setup\'>\n									\n									<button type=\'button\' id=\'yes-\" . esc_attr( $id ) . \"-add-payment\' class=\'professional-action-button float-center payment-not-setup\' style=\'float:left\'>\n											<span id=\'professional-add-payment\' class=\'ADD-PAYMENT payment-not-setup\'>ADD PAYMENT METHOD</span>\n									</button>\n									<button type=\'button\' id=\'yes-\" . esc_attr( $id ) . \"-buy-now\' class=\'professional-action-button-disabled float-center payment-method-setup\' style=\'float:left; bottom:-2%;\' disabled=\'true\'>\n											<span id=\'professional-buy-now\' class=\'ADD-PAYMENT-DISABLED payment-method-setup\'>BUY NOW</span>\n									</button>\n								</div>\n								<div id=\'cleared\'></div>\n							</div>\n\n\n							<div id=\'requesting-translation-screen\' class=\'requesting-element\'>\n										<img class=\'requesting-element payment-portal-image\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/translation-logo.png\'/>\n										<img class=\'requesting-element payment-portal-loading\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) .\"/img/loading.gif\'/>\n										<div class=\'requesting-element Analyzing-translations\'>Requesting Translations</div>\n							</div>\n\n							<div id=\'requesting-translation-success-screen\' class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element\'>\n								<img class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element payment-portal-image\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/translation-logo.png\'/>\n								<img class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element green-check-success\' src=\'\" . esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) . \"/img/checkmark-green.svg\'/>\n								<div class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element professional-translation-view-invoice\' style=\'height: 28px;\'>Your translations have been successfully requested.</div>\n								<div class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element professional-translation-view-invoice\'>You will be receiving a confirmation email shortly.</div>\n								<div class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element professional-translation-view-invoice\'>Your credit card will be charged <span id=\'professional-translation-cost-success\' class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element\'></span></div>\n								<button type=\'button\' id=\'professional-post-transaction-button\' class=\'professional-translation-request-success-element professional-view-invoice-btn float-center\'>\n										<span id=\'professional-post-transaction\' class=\'ADD-PAYMENT professional-translation-request-success-element\'>OK</span>\n								</button>\n							</div>\n\n\n\n							<div id=\'requesting-translation-error-screen\' class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element\'>\n								<img class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element payment-portal-image\' src=\'\". esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL )  .\"/img/translation-logo.png\'/>\n								<img class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element green-check-success\' src=\'\" . esc_url_raw( LINGOTEK_URL ) . \"/img/error.svg\'/>\n								<div id=\'error-requesting-translation-ltk\' class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element professional-translation-view-invoice\'>There was an error requesting your translation.</div>\n								<div id=\'error-requesting-translation-ltk-2\' class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element professional-translation-view-invoice\'>Please refresh the page and try again.</div>\n								<button type=\'button\' id=\'professional-post-transaction-button\' class=\'professional-translation-request-error-element professional-view-invoice-btn float-center\'>\n										<span id=\'professional-post-transaction-failure\' class=\'ADD-PAYMENT professional-translation-request-error-element\'>Ok</span>\n								</button>\n							</div>\n\n							</div>\n							\".$this->get_payment_portal_html().\"\n							\n							\";i:2331;s:7:\"Account\";i:2332;s:8:\"Defaults\";i:2333;s:11:\"Preferences\";i:2334;s:9:\"Utilities\";i:2335;s:9:\"%s source\";i:2336;s:38:\"The language utility ran successfully.\";i:2337;s:70:\"Your chosen settings have updated successfully for all selected sites.\";i:2338;s:44:\"Please choose at least one destination site.\";i:2339;s:44:\"Your new projects were successfully created.\";i:2340;s:42:\"Your new project was successfully created.\";i:2341;s:25:\"Lingotek Network Settings\";i:2342;s:61:\"Copy Lingotek settings from the source site to multiple sites\";i:2343;s:11:\"Source Site\";i:2344;s:16:\"Destination Site\";i:2345;s:16:\"Settings to copy\";i:2346;s:9:\"Community\";i:2347;s:8:\"Profiles\";i:2348;s:13:\"Content Types\";i:2349;s:11:\"New Project\";i:2350;s:95:\"Create a new project using the name of the selected site (Recommended for a newly created site)\";i:2351;s:8:\"Language\";i:2352;s:107:\"Set <i>default language</i> as the language for all existing content that has not been assigned a language.\";i:2353;s:6:\"Import\";i:2354;s:9:\"Extension\";i:2355;s:6:\"Locale\";i:2356;s:11:\"Upload Date\";i:2357;s:12:\"Project Name\";i:2358;s:145:\"We could not parse the data from this document.\n        Are you sure that it is in a recognizable format, such as JSON, XML, HTML, or plain text?\";i:2359;s:14:\"No title found\";i:2360;s:18:\"Failed to load XML\";i:2361;s:79:\"No files were selected to import. Please check the desired documents to import.\";i:2362;s:19:\"Import documents as\";i:2363;s:44:\"The post status for newly imported documents\";i:2364;s:5:\"Draft\";i:2365;s:14:\"Pending Review\";i:2366;s:9:\"Published\";i:2367;s:19:\"Privately Published\";i:2368;s:50:\"In which format would you like your imports to be?\";i:2369;s:43:\"Your preferences were successfully updated.\";i:2370;s:49:\"Your translation profile was sucessfully deleted.\";i:2371;s:53:\"You must provide a name for your translation profile.\";i:2372;s:47:\"Your translation profile was sucessfully saved.\";i:2373;s:43:\"Your callback url was successfully updated.\";i:2374;s:84:\"Translation profiles allow you to quickly configure and re-use translation settings.\";i:2375;s:15:\"Add New Profile\";i:2376;s:49:\"Your <i>Custom Fields</i> were sucessfully saved.\";i:2377;s:54:\"Your <i>Custom Fields</i> were sucessfully identified.\";i:2378;s:26:\"Custom Field Configuration\";i:2379;s:125:\"Custom Fields can be translated, copied, or ignored. Click \"Refresh Custom Fields\" to identify and enable your custom fields.\";i:2380;s:41:\"Edit on Polylang Strings Translation page\";i:2381;s:42:\"Your content types were sucessfully saved.\";i:2382;s:161:\"Content types can be configured to use any translation profile.  Additionally, translation profiles can be set based on the language the content was authored in.\";i:2383;s:23:\"Use global default (%s)\";i:2384;s:20:\"Use default settings\";i:2385;s:19:\"Use custom settings\";i:2386;s:20:\"Copy source language\";i:2387;s:12:\"Profile name\";i:2388;s:16:\"Default settings\";i:2389;s:41:\"Update the callback url for this project.\";i:2390;s:14:\"Not configured\";i:2391;s:16:\"Target languages\";i:2392;s:17:\"Document Metadata\";i:2393;s:63:\"You are about to permanently delete this profile. Are you sure?\";i:2394;s:9:\"Dashboard\";i:2395;s:45:\"The language update utility ran successfully.\";i:2396;s:63:\"You are about to overwrite existing translations. Are you sure?\";i:2397;s:28:\"Translate into new languages\";i:2398;s:251:\"Easily translate your site into new languages by adding the desired language to your site.  Lingotek allows you to quickly add any of the most frequently used locales using the <a href=\"%s\" title=\"Translation &gt; Dashboard\">Translation Dashboard</a>.\";i:2399;s:31:\"Automatically translate content\";i:2400;s:285:\"Machine translation is an excellent option if you\'re on a tight budget, looking for near-instant results, and are okay with less-than-perfect quality. The plugin allows you to quickly and automatically translate your site (the cost is covered by Lingotek for up to 100,000 characters).\";i:2401;s:32:\"Request professional translation\";i:2402;s:395:\"Use your own translation agency or tap into Lingotek\'s network of more than 5,000+ in-country translators. Content transfer is fully automated between WordPress and Lingotek. You\'ll have full visibility into the translation process every step of the way. And once the translations are completed, they\'ll automatically download and publish to your website according to the preferences you\'ve set.\";i:2403;s:30:\"Fully compatible with Polylang\";i:2404;s:351:\"Polylang and Lingotek work together seamlessly.  Continue to use Polylang for content that you want to translate inside WordPress, while sending other content to be translated by Lingotek. The <b style=\"color: %s\">orange</b> icons indicate Lingotek statuses/actions while the <b style=\"color: %s\">blue</b> icons continue to represent Polylang actions.\";i:2405;s:24:\"Use translation profiles\";i:2406;s:272:\"One of the most time-consuming activities of any multilingual web-site project is managing the ongoing flow of changes and additions to site content and configurations. Translation profiles were created to allow you to create and save and re-use your translation settings.\";i:2407;s:21:\"Content type profiles\";i:2408;s:530:\"Content type profiles. Manually choosing which content to upload and download is rarely what a content administrator wants to do, and automating the upload of every change is not workable because there are various types of content. Each type of translatable content can be assigned to a customizable profile. For example, by default, we like to have Posts use an <i>Automatic</i> profile so that content will automatically be uploaded for translation and the resulting translations automatically be downloaded back into WordPress.\";i:2409;s:20:\"Need Extra Services?\";i:2410;s:44:\"Start the process of getting extra services.\";i:2411;s:53:\"Do you need someone to run your localization project?\";i:2412;s:33:\"Do you need customized workflows?\";i:2413;s:68:\"Do you you have existing Translation Memories you would like to use?\";i:2414;s:55:\"Do you need help creating glossaries and terminologies?\";i:2415;s:16:\"Request Services\";i:2416;s:45:\"What Does The Lingotek Translation Plugin Do?\";i:2417;s:302:\"Lingotek works in conjunction with the Polylang plugin (the plumbing to make WordPress multilingual ready) simplifying the process of creating and maintaining your multilingual website. You write posts, pages, and create categories and post tags as usual, and then define the language for each of them.\";i:2418;s:37:\"Lingotek Translation General Overview\";i:2419;s:17:\"1. Create content\";i:2420;s:159:\"Whether you write a blog post, create a page for your site, or have existing posts and pages, any of your Wordpress content can be uploaded to <i>Lingotek</i>.\";i:2421;s:98:\"The examples shown below are for Pages but translation for other content types works the same way!\";i:2422;s:34:\"Create a new page for translation.\";i:2423;s:29:\"2. Upload content to Lingotek\";i:2424;s:91:\"Your Wordpress content can be uploaded to <i>Lingotek</i> with the simple push of a button.\";i:2425;s:61:\"Content has been created and is ready for upload to Lingotek.\";i:2426;s:44:\"3. Request translations for target languages\";i:2427;s:161:\"Request translation for a specific language by clicking on the orange plus icon, for all languages at once, or in bulk by using the <i>Bulk Actions</i> dropdown.\";i:2428;s:62:\"The source content is uploaded and ready for target languages.\";i:2429;s:25:\"4. Translate your content\";i:2430;s:176:\"Your content will now be translated into your selected target languages by free machine translation or, if you contract with <i>Lingotek</i>, professional translation services.\";i:2431;s:31:\"Your translations are underway.\";i:2432;s:24:\"5. Download translations\";i:2433;s:205:\"Once your translations are complete they will be marked ready for download. You can download translations for all languages, each language individually, or in bulk (using the <i>Bulk Actions</i> dropdown).\";i:2434;s:41:\"Your translations are ready for download.\";i:2435;s:30:\"6. Your content is translated!\";i:2436;s:299:\"The orange pencil icons indicate that your translations are finished, downloaded, and current within your Wordpress site. Clicking on any one of the pencils will direct you to the Lingotek Workbench for that specific language. Here you can make updates and changes to your translations if necessary.\";i:2437;s:33:\"Your content has been translated.\";i:2438;s:27:\"What do all the icons mean?\";i:2439;s:13:\"Upload Source\";i:2440;s:50:\"There is content ready to be uploaded to Lingotek.\";i:2441;s:11:\"In Progress\";i:2442;s:87:\"Content is importing to Lingotek or a target language is being added to source content.\";i:2443;s:15:\"Source Uploaded\";i:2444;s:49:\"The source content has been uploaded to Lingotek.\";i:2445;s:19:\"Request Translation\";i:2446;s:68:\"Request a translation of the source content. (Add a target language)\";i:2447;s:20:\"Download Translation\";i:2448;s:45:\"Download the translated content to Wordpress.\";i:2449;s:19:\"Translation Current\";i:2450;s:114:\"The translation is complete. (Clicking on this icon will allow you to edit translations in the Lingotek Workbench)\";i:2451;s:11:\"Out of Sync\";i:2452;s:110:\"You have made changes to source content. The source must be sent to Lingotek again for additional translation.\";i:2453;s:42:\"Lingotek Professional Translation Overview\";i:2454;s:42:\"What Is Lingotek Professional Translation?\";i:2455;s:274:\"Lingotek Professional Translation is a workflow that allows you to connect with audiences around the globe using Lingotek\\\'s network of 5000+ professional, in-country, translators. Professional Translation ensures that your audiences will feel the sentiment of your content.\";i:2456;s:10:\"How To Use\";i:2457;s:158:\"Use the \"Lingotek Professional Translation\" workflow to enable this feature.  This can be done from any of the following area in the Lingotek plugin settings:\";i:2458;s:43:\"Translation > Manage > Translation Profiles\";i:2459;s:33:\"Translation > Settings > Defaults\";i:2460;s:194:\"After selecting this workflow a dialog box will pop up prompting you to enter a payment method. Clicking LATER will close the dialog box and allow you to come back later to add a payment method.\";i:2461;s:95:\"Clicking the ADD PAYMENT METHOD button will redirect you to the Lingotek Secure Payment Portal.\";i:2462;s:121:\"From the Payment Portal you will enter your payment information. Then you will be redirected back to your WordPress site.\";i:2463;s:170:\"After the workflow has been set you can access the professional translation request menu by clicking on the orange plus icon located on any page that contains your posts.\";i:2464;s:289:\"When requesting a document for translation with the Lingotek Professional Translation workflow enabled you will see one of two dialog boxes. If you don\\\'t have a payment method set up you will see the following dialog box allowing you to view translation quotes on your selected documents.\";i:2465;s:141:\"If you do have a payment method enabled you will see the following dialog box that will allow you to purchase your professional translations.\";i:2466;s:132:\"After purchasing one or more professional translations you will see a success message and will receive a payment confirmation email.\";i:2467;s:120:\"The status of your translation will change to the Translator icon while your document is being processed and translated.\";i:2468;s:90:\"You can set up or edit your payment method from the Translation > Settings > Account page.\";i:2469;s:24:\"Questions and answers...\";i:2470;s:26:\"How does this really work?\";i:2471;s:204:\"<i>Polylang</i> puts in the framework to make WordPress multilingual and <i>Lingotek</i> leverages that framework to provide localization through machine translation and professional translation services.\";i:2472;s:33:\"What does the Lingotek plugin do?\";i:2473;s:227:\"<i>Lingotek</i> has teamed up with <i>Polylang</i> to offer a simple way to make your WordPress site truly multilingual. Manage all your multilingual content in the same site. No need to have a different site for each language!\";i:2474;s:25:\"How can I add a language?\";i:2475;s:159:\"On the <i>translation dashboard</i>, click on the <i>Translate my site into...</i> textbox and choose from the list or start typing to quickly find a language.\";i:2476;s:28:\"How can I remove a language?\";i:2477;s:108:\"On the <i>translation dashboard</i>, click on the blue check mark for the language you would like to remove.\";i:2478;s:132:\"Note: If you have translated content in a language you will not be able to remove that language until that content has been deleted.\";i:2479;s:51:\"Why can\'t I upload my existing content to Lingotek?\";i:2480;s:50:\"Can I use my own translation agency with Lingotek?\";i:2481;s:60:\"How can I check the overall translation progress of my site?\";i:2482;s:204:\"On the <i>translation dashboard</i>, the bars under <i>Completed Percentage</i> show the translation progress of content for each language. You can filter by content type or show progress for all content.\";i:2483;s:63:\"Why are there two different shades of blue in the progress bar?\";i:2484;s:161:\"The <i>translation dashboard</i> not only shows how much of your content is translated, but also indicates the language that your source content was authored in.\";i:2485;s:92:\"<i>Dark Blue:</i> Indicates that this is a source language that the content was authored in.\";i:2486;s:97:\"<i>Light Blue:</i> Indicates that this is a target language that the content was translated into.\";i:2487;s:53:\"What happens when I <i>Disassociate Translations</i>?\";i:2488;s:165:\"When content is disassociated, the connection between WordPress and <i>Lingotek</i> is safely removed so that translations can be solely managed inside of WordPress.\";i:2489;s:100:\"How do I translate strings within widgets or general WordPress settings (e.g., Site Title, Tagline)?\";i:2490;s:18:\"Lingotek Workbench\";i:2491;s:336:\"Lingotek Translation is the only WordPress plugin to integrate a Translation Management System directly into WordPress, thus allowing the WordPress community to use professional-grade translation technologies (e.g. machine translation, translation memory, CAT tool) without ever having to leave the comfort of the WordPress environment.\";i:2492;s:21:\"Translation Dashboard\";i:2493;s:210:\"The <i>translation dashboard</i> allows you to view your site languages, add and remove new languages, check the overall translation progress of your site, see site analytics, and connect with Lingotek support.\";i:2494;s:55:\"The Lingotek plugin for WordPress is created with love.\";i:2495;s:15:\"Project Leaders\";i:2496;s:12:\"Contributors\";i:2497;s:16:\"No content types\";i:2498;s:25:\"Disassociating content...\";i:2499;s:98:\"Set <i>default language</i> as the language for all content that has not been assigned a language.\";i:2500;s:47:\"Disassociate all the content from Lingotek TMS.\";i:2501;s:80:\"You are about to disassociate all your content from Lingotek TMS. Are you sure ?\";i:2502;s:13:\"Run Utilities\";i:2503;s:81:\"Do you already have a Lingotek account? <a href=\"%s\">Connect Lingotek Account</a>\";i:2504;s:27:\"Download translation status\";i:2505;s:49:\"The post status for newly downloaded translations\";i:2506;s:19:\"Same as source post\";i:2507;s:20:\"Auto upload statuses\";i:2508;s:119:\"The post statuses checked above are enabled for automatic upload (when using automatic uploading translation profiles).\";i:2509;s:14:\"Disassociation\";i:2510;s:118:\"Your documents will remain in your WordPress site but will be deleted from the Lingotek TMS if this option is checked.\";i:2511;s:55:\"Delete documents from Lingotek TMS when disassociating.\";i:2512;s:16:\"Deleting Content\";i:2513;s:84:\"When enabled, deleting source or target content will also delete all linked content.\";i:2514;s:21:\"Delete linked content\";i:2515;s:46:\"When checked, an \"Import\" submenu will appear.\";i:2516;s:52:\"Enable importing from Lingotek Content Cloud. (beta)\";i:2517;s:32:\"Automatic Status Update Interval\";i:2518;s:64:\"Changes the rate at which content statuses update automatically.\";i:2519;s:77:\"Resources from Lingotek were successfully updated for projects and workflows.\";i:2520;s:63:\"Resources from Lingotek were successfully updated for projects.\";i:2521;s:64:\"Resources from Lingotek were successfully updated for workflows.\";i:2522;s:117:\"The Lingotek TMS is currently unavailable. Please try again later. If the problem persists, contact Lingotek Support.\";i:2523;s:44:\"Your <i>Defaults</i> were sucessfully saved.\";i:2524;s:17:\"Refresh Resources\";i:2525;s:8:\"Login ID\";i:2526;s:12:\"Access Token\";i:2527;s:12:\"API Endpoint\";i:2528;s:156:\"Are you sure you would like to disconnect your Lingotek account? \\n\\nAfter disconnecting, you will need to re-connect an account to continue using Lingotek.\";i:2529;s:10:\"Disconnect\";i:2530;s:8:\"Features\";i:2531;s:8:\"Tutorial\";i:2532;s:7:\"Credits\";i:2533;s:19:\"Welcome to Lingotek\";i:2534;s:92:\"Thank you for updating! Lingotek offers convenient cloud-based localization and translation.\";i:2535;s:15:\"Edit Form Types\";i:2536;s:10:\"Form Types\";i:2537;s:8:\"Form key\";i:2538;s:5:\"Trash\";i:2539;s:49:\"cf7-form shortcode key error, unable to find form\";i:2540;s:29:\"Dynamic Select Dropdown field\";i:2541;s:20:\"Enter your full name\";i:2542;s:19:\"Enter a valid email\";i:2543;s:25:\"the topic of your message\";i:2544;s:21:\"Enter a brief message\";i:2545;s:9:\"Make grid\";i:2546;s:11:\"Insert form\";i:2547;s:21:\"%s keys switch panels\";i:2548;s:17:\"Advanced uploader\";i:2549;s:43:\"You do not have permission to upload files.\";i:2550;s:40:\"A label is required for all destinations\";i:2551;s:94:\"Expecting a valid directory! Please fix, the directory needs to exist in the filesystem first.\";i:2552;s:88:\"To add to Wordpress Library Destination must be in within uploads directory! Please fix.\";i:2553;s:76:\"Expecting a valid HTML Colour Code! Please fix Colour of progress bar field.\";i:2554;s:62:\"Expecting a number! Please fix Overide form header calulation.\";i:2555;s:25:\"<h3>Attachment Image</h3>\";i:2556;s:5:\"Sizes\";i:2557;s:14:\"Duplicate Post\";i:2558;s:7:\"warning\";i:2559;s:17:\"Possible reasons:\";i:2560;s:44:\"You cannot use this feature on the frontend.\";i:2561;s:27:\"More features (<b>free</b>)\";i:2562;s:13:\"More features\";i:2563;s:13:\"Code cleaning\";i:2564;s:52:\"Clears the source code of the page from unused code.\";i:2565;s:11:\"Improve SEO\";i:2566;s:82:\"Removes duplicate pages, closes external links, changes the headers of the server.\";i:2567;s:15:\"Site protection\";i:2568;s:71:\"Enables and disables features that improve the protection of your site.\";i:2569;s:16:\"Disable comments\";i:2570;s:58:\"Disables comments on the entire site or on specific pages.\";i:2571;s:14:\"Manage updates\";i:2572;s:123:\"Enables or disables automatically updates for plugins, themes and core. It is also possible\r\n							to disable all updates.\";i:2573;s:14:\"Manage widgets\";i:2574;s:36:\"Allows you to remove unused widgets.\";i:2575;s:18:\"Speed Optimization\";i:2576;s:88:\"Increases performance by disabling unused functions and reducing the number of requests.\";i:2577;s:12:\"Site privacy\";i:2578;s:98:\"Allows you to hide the version of the site and plugins. Allows you to hide your\r\n							WordPress.\";i:2579;s:10:\"Easy setup\";i:2580;s:75:\"In quick mode, you can easily configure the plugin according to your needs.\";i:2581;s:33:\"Get the ultimate plugin 100% FREE\";i:2582;s:27:\"Upgrade to Clearfy Business\";i:2583;s:43:\"Oops... Sorry for the inconvenience caused!\";i:2584;s:106:\"Complete multisite support is available in Clearfy Business and Clearfy Business Revolution packages only!\";i:2585;s:158:\"You can activate the plugin on each website and use it with zero limitations. But you can’t save the plugin’s settings under the Super Administrator role!\";i:2586;s:17:\"Activate license \";i:2587;s:25:\"4 premium components now;\";i:2588;s:61:\"40 new premium components within a year for the single price;\";i:2589;s:18:\"Multisite support;\";i:2590;s:18:\"Advanced settings;\";i:2591;s:7:\"No ads;\";i:2592;s:16:\"Perfect support.\";i:2593;s:37:\"MORE IN CLEARFY <span>BUSINESS</span>\";i:2594;s:92:\"A neutral setting that can not harm your site, but you must be sure that you need to use it.\";i:2595;s:155:\"When set this option, you must be careful. Plugins and themes may depend on this function. You must be sure that you can disable this feature for the site.\";i:2596;s:45:\"Absolutely safe setting, We recommend to use.\";i:2597;s:59:\"Hover to the icon to get help for the feature you selected.\";i:2598;s:46:\"Do you want the plugin to improved and update?\";i:2599;s:136:\"Help the author, leave a review on wordpress.org. Thanks to feedback, I will know that the plugin is really useful to you and is needed.\";i:2600;s:65:\"And also write your ideas on how to extend or improve the plugin.\";i:2601;s:25:\"Go rate us and push ideas\";i:2602;s:31:\"Donation for plugin development\";i:2603;s:18:\"hide extra options\";i:2604;s:26:\"(use default website font)\";i:2605;s:11:\"Sans Serif:\";i:2606;s:6:\"Serif:\";i:2607;s:11:\"Monospaced:\";i:2608;s:18:\"The list is empty.\";i:2609;s:9:\"- empty -\";i:2610;s:7:\"Add new\";i:2611;s:8:\"vertical\";i:2612;s:10:\"horizontal\";i:2613;s:44:\"Select a side and move the slider to set up:\";i:2614;s:9:\"Standard:\";i:2615;s:13:\"Google Fonts:\";i:2616;s:44:\"Unable to retrieve the list of Google Fonts.\";i:2617;s:44:\"Invalide response from the Google Fonts API.\";i:2618;s:53:\"Unexpected error. The list of Google Fonts are empty.\";i:2619;s:2:\"On\";i:2620;s:3:\"Off\";i:2621;s:12:\"Change color\";i:2622;s:8:\"re-color\";i:2623;s:13:\"Select color:\";i:2624;s:65:\"Changing the color may takes a minute or more. Please be patient.\";i:2625;s:29:\"Выберите период\";i:2626;s:166:\"Если Вкл., вы сможете установить настройки выбора записей за установленный период времени.\";i:2627;s:11:\"Show shadow\";i:2628;s:11:\"Hide shadow\";i:2629;s:76:\"You are trying to call this earlier than the plugin menu will be registered.\";i:2630;s:44:\"The settings have been updated successfully!\";i:2631;s:161:\"It seems that a caching/performance plugin is active on this site. Please manually invalidate that plugin\'s cache after making any changes to the settings below.\";i:2632;s:5:\"1 min\";i:2633;s:5:\"2 min\";i:2634;s:5:\"5 min\";i:2635;s:6:\"10 min\";i:2636;s:6:\"30 min\";i:2637;s:6:\"60 min\";i:2638;s:5:\"daily\";i:2639;s:124:\"It is not possible to create a temporary file. Throw error \' . $temp_attachment->get_error_message(), \'robin-image-optimizer\";i:2640;s:14:\"file not found\";i:2641;s:13:\"curl not work\";i:2642;s:31:\"Unable to create backup folder.\";i:2643;s:34:\"Unable to create backup subfolder.\";i:2644;s:29:\"Unable to create temp folder.\";i:2645;s:50:\"Could not copy the file to the temporary directory\";i:2646;s:81:\"It is not possible to create a temporary file, the backup folder is not writable.\";i:2647;s:50:\"Unable to restore from a backup. There is no file.\";i:2648;s:30:\"No access for writing backups.\";i:2649;s:35:\"The uploads folder is not writable.\";i:2650;s:15:\"Image optimizer\";i:2651;s:13:\"New Filesize:\";i:2652;s:16:\"Original Saving:\";i:2653;s:18:\"Original Filesize:\";i:2654;s:6:\"Level:\";i:2655;s:8:\"lossless\";i:2656;s:5:\"lossy\";i:2657;s:4:\"High\";i:2658;s:21:\"Thumbnails Optimized:\";i:2659;s:15:\"Overall Saving:\";i:2660;s:14:\"Error Message:\";i:2661;s:24:\"Optimization in progress\";i:2662;s:14:\"Re-Optimize to\";i:2663;s:20:\"Recovery in progress\";i:2664;s:16:\"Restore original\";i:2665;s:8:\"Optimize\";i:2666;s:32:\"Webcraftic Robin image optimizer\";i:2667;s:8:\"Donation\";i:2668;s:160:\"<b>Clearfy Business</b> is a paid package of components for the popular free WordPress plugin named Clearfy. You get access to all paid components at one price.\";i:2669;s:107:\"Paid license guarantees that you can download and update existing and future paid components of the plugin.\";i:2670;s:13:\"Main Settings\";i:2671;s:20:\"Plugin configuration\";i:2672;s:59:\"This section you can set main images optimization settings.\";i:2673;s:19:\"Optimization server\";i:2674;s:52:\"Server 1 (recommended) - image size limit up to 5 MB\";i:2675;s:38:\"Server 2 - image size limit up to 1 MB\";i:2676;s:32:\"Server 4 - image compressor test\";i:2677;s:42:\"Server 3 - you can\'t use it on a localhost\";i:2678;s:467:\"We use several free servers for image optimization and can’t fully guarantee their stable performance. The server can be not available in some countries due to the political reasons. There is a solution: if one of the servers is not available or can’t optimize the image, you can try to switch to the alternative server. Each server has individual limitations for image weight and optimization level. By default, you have the best server with minimum limitations.\";i:2679;s:16:\"Compression mode\";i:2680;s:8:\"Lossless\";i:2681;s:267:\"This mode provides lossless compression and your images will be optimized without visible changes. If you want an ideal image quality, we recommend this mode. The size of the files will be reduced approximately 2 times. If this is not enough for you, try other modes.\";i:2682;s:5:\"Lossy\";i:2683;s:236:\"This mode provides an ideal optimization of your images without significant quality loss. The file size will be reduced approximately 5 times with a slight decrease in image quality. In most cases that cannot be seen with the naked eye.\";i:2684;s:301:\"This mode will use all available optimization methods for maximum image compression. The file size will be reduced approximately 7 times. The quality of some images may deteriorate slightly. Use this mode if you need the maximum weight reduction, and you are ready to accept the loss of image quality.\";i:2685;s:54:\"Select the compression mode appropriate for your case.\";i:2686;s:27:\"Auto optimization on upload\";i:2687;s:148:\"Automatically compress all images that you upload directly to the WordPress media library, when editing pages and posts or using themes and plugins.\";i:2688;s:13:\"Backup images\";i:2689;s:90:\"Before optimizing, all your images will be saved in a separate folder for future recovery.\";i:2690;s:9:\"Error Log\";i:2691;s:66:\"Enable error logging. The log will be displayed on a separate tab.\";i:2692;s:15:\"Leave EXIF data\";i:2693;s:259:\"EXIF is information stored in photos: camera model, shutter speed, exposure compensation, ISO, GPS, etc. By default, the plugin removes EXIF extended data. If your project is dedicated to photography and you need to display this data, then enable this option.\";i:2694;s:12:\"Optimization\";i:2695;s:59:\"Here you can specify additional image optimization options.\";i:2696;s:21:\"Resizing large images\";i:2697;s:186:\"When you upload images from a camera or stock, they may be too high resolution and it is not necessary for web. The option allows you to automatically change images resolution on upload.\";i:2698;s:27:\"Enter the maximum size (px)\";i:2699;s:224:\"Set the maximum images resolution on the long side. For horizontal images, this will be the width, and for vertical images - the height. The resolution of the images will be changed proportionally according to the set value.\";i:2700;s:19:\"Optimize thumbnails\";i:2701;s:101:\"Choose which sizes of thumbnails should be optimized and uncheck those that do not need optimization.\";i:2702;s:22:\"Scheduled optimization\";i:2703;s:34:\"Schedule your images optimization.\";i:2704;s:29:\"Enable Scheduled Optimization\";i:2705;s:133:\"You can enable image optimization on schedule. The plugin will optimize specified number of images automatically after selected time.\";i:2706;s:4:\"Hour\";i:2707;s:3:\"Day\";i:2708;s:9:\"Run every\";i:2709;s:47:\"Select time at which the task will be repeated.\";i:2710;s:20:\"Images per iteration\";i:2711;s:164:\"Specify the number of images that will be optimized during the job. For example, if you enter 5 and select 5 min, the plugin will optimize 5 images every 5 minutes.\";i:2712;s:14:\"Manage backups\";i:2713;s:64:\"You can restore the original images from a backup or clear them.\";i:2714;s:7:\"Restore\";i:2715;s:57:\"Are you sure that you want to clear image backups folder?\";i:2716;s:12:\"Clear Backup\";i:2717;s:18:\"Restore completed.\";i:2718;s:30:\"The backup folder was cleared.\";i:2719;s:132:\"In this section, you can track image optimization errors. Sending this log to us, will help in solving possible optimization issues.\";i:2720;s:21:\"Robin image optimizer\";i:2721;s:23:\"Compress bulk of images\";i:2722;s:7:\"General\";i:2723;s:7:\"Servers\";i:2724;s:308:\"Please, find the list of available servers for image optimization below. If the server has a state “<b style=\"color:red\">Down</b>”, it means that the server is not available, and you should choose another one. “<b style=\"color:green\">Stable</b>” means that the server is available and you can use it.\";i:2725;s:6:\"Server\";i:2726;s:6:\"Limits\";i:2727;s:7:\"Actions\";i:2728;s:6:\"Stable\";i:2729;s:9:\"IMG > 5MB\";i:2730;s:9:\"IMG > 1MB\";i:2731;s:9:\"No limits\";i:2732;s:324:\"There are limitations for the specified server (server 1) – you can’t optimize images with the size greater than <span style=\"color:red\">5MB</span>. But you can enable the “Resizing large images” feature to reduce the image weight due to the proportional resizing before sending the file to the optimization server. \";i:2733;s:394:\"There are limitations for the specified server (server 2) – you can’t optimize images with the size greater than <span style=\"color:red\">1MB</span>. But you can enable the “Resizing large images” feature to reduce the image weight due to the proportional resizing before sending the file to the optimization server. Note: this server supports only one compression mode – “Normal”.\";i:2734;s:94:\"There are limitations for the specified server (server 3) – you can\'t use it on a localhost.\";i:2735;s:31:\"This server has no limitations.\";i:2736;s:28:\"Image optimization dashboard\";i:2737;s:82:\"Monitor image optimization statistics and run on demand or scheduled optimization.\";i:2738;s:13:\"You optimized\";i:2739;s:24:\"of your website\'s images\";i:2740;s:11:\"Unoptimized\";i:2741;s:9:\"Optimized\";i:2742;s:5:\"Error\";i:2743;s:10:\"Statistics\";i:2744;s:75:\"that\'s the number of original images<br> you optimized with Image Optimizer\";i:2745;s:13:\"Original size\";i:2746;s:14:\"Optimized size\";i:2747;s:54:\"that\'s the size you saved <br>by using Image Optimizer\";i:2748;s:48:\"All images from the media library are optimized.\";i:2749;s:34:\"Optimization in progress. Remained\";i:2750;s:7:\"images.\";i:2751;s:3:\"Run\";i:2752;s:4:\"Stop\";i:2753;s:49:\"Do you want to start optimization without backup?\";i:2754;s:6:\"Resume\";i:2755;s:19:\"Images optimization\";i:2756;s:6:\"Normal\";i:2757;s:13:\"for all days!\";i:2758;s:3:\"yes\";i:2759;s:12:\"Booking Form\";i:2760;s:34:\"Select default custom booking form\";i:2761;s:12:\"Custom Forms\";i:2762;s:5:\"Reset\";i:2763;s:28:\"Delete selected booking form\";i:2764;s:19:\"Add New Custom Form\";i:2765;s:29:\"Type the name of booking form\";i:2766;s:6:\"Create\";i:2767;s:15:\"Create new form\";i:2768;s:7:\"Deleted\";i:2769;s:35:\"There are no extended booking forms\";i:2770;s:19:\"Create dates filter\";i:2771;s:30:\"Create conditional days filter\";i:2772;s:18:\"Set Valuation Days\";i:2773;s:13:\"Nothing Found\";i:2774;s:8:\"Resource\";i:2775;s:19:\"Hide season filters\";i:2776;s:29:\"Show all exist season filters\";i:2777;s:4:\"days\";i:2778;s:5:\"Costs\";i:2779;s:6:\"Season\";i:2780;s:12:\"Add new cost\";i:2781;s:7:\"Example\";i:2782;s:8:\"Warning!\";i:2783;s:14:\" for all days!\";i:2784;s:23:\"from the cost of 1 day \";i:2785;s:9:\"per 1 day\";i:2786;s:3:\"day\";i:2787;s:3:\"For\";i:2788;s:8:\"Together\";i:2789;s:2:\"to\";i:2790;s:31:\"Additional cost in %s per 1 day\";i:2791;s:8:\"Any days\";i:2792;s:13:\"Advanced Cost\";i:2793;s:63:\"Customization of additional cost, which depend from form fields\";i:2794;s:22:\"Advanced Cost Settings\";i:2795;s:11:\"Form fields\";i:2796;s:25:\"Content of Booking Fields\";i:2797;s:5:\"Note!\";i:2798;s:89:\"Configure additional cost, which depend from selection of selectbox(es) and checkbox(es).\";i:2799;s:111:\"Fields %s(selectbox(es) and checkbox(es))%s are shown here automatically if they exist in the %sbooking form%s.\";i:2800;s:4:\"Help\";i:2801;s:12:\"Deposit type\";i:2802;s:13:\"of total cost\";i:2803;s:5:\"night\";i:2804;s:17:\"as additional sum\";i:2805;s:33:\"Enter additional cost in formats:\";i:2806;s:16:\"Enter fixed cost\";i:2807;s:38:\"Enter percentage of the entire booking\";i:2808;s:40:\"Enter fixed amount for each selected day\";i:2809;s:89:\"Enter percentage as additional sum, which is based only on original cost and not full sum\";i:2810;s:112:\"Use arithmetic expressions in cost configurations, including fields shortcodes and simple mathematics operations\";i:2811;s:31:\"Limit available days from today\";i:2812;s:61:\"Select number of available days in calendar start from today.\";i:2813;s:39:\"Unavailable time before / after booking\";i:2814;s:10:\"Important!\";i:2815;s:108:\"This feature is applying only for bookings for specific timeslots, or if activated check in/out time option.\";i:2816;s:7:\"minutes\";i:2817;s:4:\"hour\";i:2818;s:5:\"hours\";i:2819;s:14:\"Before booking\";i:2820;s:33:\"Select unavailable time interval.\";i:2821;s:13:\"After booking\";i:2822;s:6:\"day(s)\";i:2823;s:25:\"Showing cost in date cell\";i:2824;s:15:\"Currency symbol\";i:2825;s:6:\"Custom\";i:2826;s:23:\"Showing cost in tooltip\";i:2827;s:108:\" Check this box to display the daily cost with a tooltip when mouse hovers over each day on the calendar(s).\";i:2828;s: