Default Form Templates\";i:3005;s:8:\"Calendar\";i:3006;s:11:\"Email Field\";i:3007;s:78:\"This is the primary email field, which is used for sending emails to visitors.\";i:3008;s:9:\"Drop Down\";i:3009;s:12:\"Checkbox(es)\";i:3010;s:15:\"Radio Button(s)\";i:3011;s:14:\"Time Slot List\";i:3012;s:23:\"Start Time - Text field\";i:3013;s:8:\"End Time\";i:3014;s:13:\"Duration Time\";i:3015;s:6:\"fields\";i:3016;s:21:\"End Time - Text field\";i:3017;s:10:\"Start Time\";i:3018;s:27:\"Start Time - Drop Down list\";i:3019;s:25:\"End Time - Drop Down list\";i:3020;s:30:\"Duration Time - Drop Down list\";i:3021;s:5:\"field\";i:3022;s:49:\"Different time slots, for the different week days\";i:3023;s:285:\"This feature provides the possibility to use the different time slot selections in the booking form for the different week days or different days - which are assigned to the specific season filters. So each week day (day of specific season filter) can have a different time slots list.\";i:3024;s:75:\"The general structure of the configuration %scondition rule%s is as follows\";i:3025;s:337:\"%sname%s – the unique name of the condition group, containing several conditions with different values. For example, if you want to have specific HTML content for the different week days, you can have several conditions, with the same name but with different value parameters in conditions. Please check more about it, in the examples.\";i:3026;s:398:\"%stype%s – type of the condition. There are 2 types of condition: \"weekday\" and \"season\". \"weekday\" – is the condition rule based on the selected day of week value, like Monday, Tuesday, etc… . \"season\" – is the condition rule based on the \"season filter\" name of selected date. In other words the condition is TRUE if the selected day belongs to a season filter in the Season Filters page.\";i:3027;s:174:\"%svalue%s – value of the specific conditions. If the value is true, the content of the conditions will show in the booking form. You can have the default value (empty – \"\";i:3028;s:75:\"default value, if no dates are selected, or none exist conditions are true.\";i:3029;s:41:\"Season filter on the Season Filters page,\";i:3030;s:40:\"Season filter on the Season Filters page\";i:3031;s:99:\"Please use  %sSingle day%s selection mode in the General Booking Settings page at calendar section.\";i:3032;s:54:\"Please check more about this feature at  %sthis page%s\";i:3033;s:10:\"Time Field\";i:3034;s:46:\"The value of this field is just saved into DB.\";i:3035;s:12:\"Country List\";i:3036;s:52:\"Select the country from the predefined country list.\";i:3037;s:17:\"Language Sections\";i:3038;s:87:\"Plugin support configurations of the booking form are available in different languages.\";i:3039;s:81:\"The active language of the booking form depends on the active locale of the site.\";i:3040;s:93:\"Booking Calendar supports WPML and qTranslate plugins for dynamic changing of website locale.\";i:3041;s:5:\"Usage\";i:3042;s:30:\"English and French translation\";i:3043;s:61:\"of configuration booking form in English and French languages\";i:3044;s:164:\"Register and Translate everything in WPML plugin. Translation can be done at the WPML > \"String translation\" page. Required WPML 3.2 with String Translation plugin.\";i:3045;s:50:\"Different form fields, for the different week days\";i:3046;s:247:\"This feature provides the possibility to show the different form fields or any other HTML content in the booking form, depending on the selection of specific week day in calendar or different days, which are assigned to the specific season filters\";i:3047;s:182:\"%svalue%s – value of the specific conditions. If the value is true, so then the content of the conditions will show in the booking form. You can have the default value (empty – \"\";i:3048;s:21:\"Cost Correction Field\";i:3049;s:21:\"Discount Coupon field\";i:3050;s:10:\"Cost Hints\";i:3051;s:149:\"Insert these shortcodes into form to %sshow info i