"Invalid\";i:3239;s:5:\"Abort\";i:3240;s:8:\"Rejected\";i:3241;s:9:\"Suspended\";i:3242;s:45:\"You need to make payment for this reservation\";i:3243;s:108:\"You need to make payment %s for reservation %s at %s. %s Please make payment on this page: %s  Thank you, %s\";i:3244;s:15:\"Payment request\";i:3245;s:82:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor after payment request\";i:3246;s:53:\"Email with  Payment Request which is sent to Visitor.\";i:3247;s:10:\"Single day\";i:3248;s:13:\"Multiple days\";i:3249;s:10:\"Range days\";i:3250;s:34:\"Type of days selection in calendar\";i:3251;s:21:\"Days selection number\";i:3252;s:23:\"Specific day(s) of week\";i:3253;s:15:\"Any day of week\";i:3254;s:18:\"Start day of range\";i:3255;s:48:\"Select your start day of range selection at week\";i:3256;s:24:\"Specific days selections\";i:3257;s:255:\"Type your %sspecific%s days, which can be selected by visitors, or leave this value empty. It can be several days separated by comma (example: %s) or by dash (example: %s, its the same like this: %s) or combination (example:%s, its the same like this: %s)\";i:3258;s:43:\"Use time selections as recurrent time slots\";i:3259;s:269:\"Check this box if you want to use recurrent time to reserve several days. This means that middle days will be partially booked by actual times, otherwise the time in the booking form will be used as check-in/check-out time for the first and last day of the reservation.\";i:3260;s:31:\"Set check out date as available\";i:3261;s:68:\"Check this option, to remove last selected day of saving to booking.\";i:3262;s:21:\"Use check in/out time\";i:3263;s:68:\"Check this option, to use check in/out time during booking process. \";i:3264;s:13:\"Check-in time\";i:3265;s:14:\"Check-Out time\";i:3266;s:29:\"Change over days as triangles\";i:3267;s:58:\"Check this option, to show change over days as triangles. \";i:3268;s:13:\"Booked Times:\";i:3269;s:27:\"Title of booked timeslot(s)\";i:3270;s:29: