w your settings on each options page!\";i:5192;s:146:\"Thank you for running the latest and greatest All in One SEO Pack ever! Please review your settings, as we\\\'re always adding new features for you!\";i:5193;s:276:\"Thank you for running the latest and greatest All in One SEO Pack ever! New since 2.2: Control who accesses your site with the new Robots.txt Editor and File Editor modules!  Enable them from the Feature Manager.  Remember to review your settings, we have added some new ones!\";i:5194;s:15:\"Everywhere Else\";i:5195;s:13:\"Title Format:\";i:5196;s:46:\"%post_title% - The original title of the post.\";i:5197;s:59:\"%%tax_%1\\$s%% - This post\'s associated %2\\$s taxonomy title\";i:5198;s:22:\"Taxonomy Title Format:\";i:5199;s:53:\"%taxonomy_title% - The original title of the taxonomy\";i:5200;s:56:\"%taxonomy_description% - The description of the taxonomy\";i:5201;s:34:\"Reset General Settings to Defaults\";i:5202;s:30:\"Reset ALL Settings to Defaults\";i:5203;s:17:\"Default - noindex\";i:5204;s:5:\"index\";i:5205;s:7:\"noindex\";i:5206;s:18:\"Default - nofollow\";i:5207;s:6:\"follow\";i:5208;s:8:\"nofollow\";i:5209;s:51:\"Warning: You\\\'re blocking access to search engines.\";i:5210;s:91:\"You can %1$s click here%2$s to go to your reading settings and toggle your blog visibility.\";i:5211;s:44:\"We\\\'ve detected you\\\'re running WooCommerce.\";i:5212;s:94:\"%1$s Upgrade%2$s to All in One SEO Pack Pro for increased SEO compatibility for your products.\";i:5213;s:100:\"Debug Warning: All in One SEO Pack meta data was included again from %1$s filter. Called %2$s times!\";i:5214;s:12:\"Debug String\";i:5215;s:3:\"SEO\";i:5216;s:14:\"Upgrade To Pro\";i:5217;s:8:\"Edit SEO\";i:5218;s:14:\"All in One SEO\";i:5219;s:21:\"Join Our Mailing List\";i:5220;s:5:\"About\";i:5221;s:67:\"%s detected a conflict; please deactivate the plugin located in %s.\";i:5222;s:19:\"Importer & Exporter\";i:5223;s:283:\"Select a valid All in One SEO Pack ini file and click \'Import\' to import options from a previous state or install of All in One SEO Pack.<br /><a href=\'https://semperplugins.com/documentation/importer-exporter-module/\' target=\'_blank\'>Click here for documentation on this setting</a>\";i:5224;s:228:\"You may choose to export settings from active modules, and content from post data.<br /><a href=\'https://semperplugins.com/documentation/importer-exporter-module/\' target=\'_blank\'>Click here for documentation on this setting</a>\";i:5225;s:228:\"Select which Post Types you want to export your All in One SEO Pack meta data for.<br /><a href=\'https://semperplugins.com/documentation/importer-exporter-module/\' target=\'_blank\'>Click here for documentation on this setting</a>\";i:5226;s:15:\"Export Settings\";i:5227;s:9:\"Post Data\";i:5228;s:18:\"Export Post Types:\";i:5229;s:196:\"Note: If General Settings is checked, the\n								General Settings, the Feature Manager settings,\n								and the following currently active modules will\n								have their settings data exported:\";i:5230;s:44:\"There are no other modules currently loaded!\";i:5231;s:87:\"You may change this by activating or deactivating\n						modules in the Feature Manager.\";i:5232;s:69:\"<b>Warning:</b> Line not matched: <b>\"%1$s\"</b>, On Line: <b>%2$s</b>\";i:5233;s:67:\"<b>Warning:</b> This following post could not be found: <b>\"%s\"</b>\";i:5234;s:44:\"Settings export file for All in One SEO Pack\";i:5235;s:15:\"Feature Manager\";i:5236;s:12:\"XML Sitemaps\";i:5237;s:117:\"Create and manage your XML Sitemaps using this feature and submit your XML Sitemap to Google, Bing/Yahoo and Ask.com.\";i:5238;s:11:\"Social Meta\";i:5239;s:107:\"Add Social Meta data to your site to deliver closer integration between your website/blog and social media.\";i:5240;s:10:\"Robots.txt\";i:5241;s:85:\"Generate and validate your robots.txt file to guide search engines through your site.\";i:5242;s:11:\"File Editor\";i:5243;s:48:\"Edit your .htaccess file to fine-tune your site.\";i:5244;s:61:\"Exports and imports your All in One SEO Pack plugin settings.\";i:5245;s:15:\"Bad Bot Blocker\";i:5246;s:56:\"Stop badly behaving bots from slowing down your website.\";i:5247;s:11:\"Performance\";i:5248;s:65:\"Optimize performance related to SEO and check your system status.\";i:5249;s:14:\"Coming Soon...\";i:5250;s:9:\"Image SEO\";i:5251;s:120:\"Create and manage your Video Sitemap using this feature and submit your Video Sitemap to Google, Bing/Yahoo and Ask.com.\";i:5252;s:16:\"Pro Version Only\";i:5253;s:15:\"Update Features\";i:5254;s:14:\"Reset Features\";i:5255;s:173:\"This setting allows you to raise your PHP memory limit to a reasonable value. Note: WordPress core and other WordPress plugins may also change the value of the memory limit.\";i:5256;s:79:\"This setting allows you to raise your PHP execution time to a reasonable value.\";i:5257;s:165:\"Use output buffering to ensure that the title gets rewritten. Enable this option if you run into issues with the title tag being set by your theme or another plugin.\";i:5258;s:18:\"Raise memory limit\";i:5259;s:22:\"Use the system default\";i:5260;s:20:\"Raise execution time\";i:5261;s:8:\"No limit\";i:5262;s:13:\"System Status\";i:5263;s:7:\"Not set\";i:5264;s:3:\"N/A\";i:5265;s:6:\" MByte\";i:5266;s:16:\"Operating System\";i:5267;s:12:\"Memory usage\";i:5268;s:13:\"MYSQL Version\";i:5269;s:8:\"SQL Mode\";i:5270;s:11:\"PHP Version\";i:5271;s:19:\"PHP Allow URL fopen\";i:5272;s:16:\"PHP Memory Limit\";i:5273;s:19:\"PHP Max Upload Size\";i:5274;s:17:\"PHP Max Post Size\";i:5275;s:27:\"PHP Max Script Execute Time\";i:5276;s:16:\"PHP Exif support\";i:5277;s:16:\"PHP IPTC support\";i:5278;s:15:\"PHP XML support\";i:5279;s:8:\"Site URL\";i:5280;s:8:\"Home URL\";i:5281;s:17:\"WordPress Version\";i:5282;s:20:\"WordPress DB Version\";i:5283;s:9:\"Multisite\";i:5284;s:12:\"Active Theme\";i:5285;s:13:\"Site Language\";i:5286;s:19:\"Front Page Displays\";i:5287;s:24:\"Search Engine Visibility\";i:5288;s:16:\".htaccess editor\";i:5289;s:14:\"Edit .htaccess\";i:5290;s:9:\".htaccess\";i:5291;s:16:\"Update .htaccess\";i:5292;s:27:\"Create RSS Sitemap as well.\";i:5293;s:183:\"Notify search engines based on the selected schedule, and also update static sitemap daily if in use. (this uses WP-Cron, so make sure this is working properly on your server as well)\";i:5294;s:153:\"Organize sitemap entries into distinct files in your sitemap. Enable this only if your sitemap contains over 50,000 URLs or the file is over 5MB in size.\";i:5295;s:78:\"Allows you to specify the maximum number of posts in a sitemap (up to 50,000).\";i:5296;s:47:\"Select which Post Types appear in your sitemap.\";i:5297;s:53:\"Select which taxonomy archives appear in your sitemap\";i:5298;s:38:\"Include Date Archives in your sitemap.\";i:5299;s:40:\"Include Author Archives in your sitemap.\";i:5300;s:31:\"Exclude Images in your sitemap.\";i:5301;s:51:\"Create a compressed sitemap file in .xml.gz format.\";i:5302;s:68:\"Places a link to your Sitemap.xml into your virtual Robots.txt file.\";i:5303;s:67:\"Dynamically creates the XML sitemap instead of using a static file.\";i:5304;s:95:\"URL to the page. This field accepts relative URLs or absolute URLs with the protocol specified.\";i:5305;s:25:\"The priority of the page.\";i:5306;s:26:\"The frequency of the page.\";i:5307;s:31:\"Last modified date of the page.\";i:5308;s:64:\"Entries from these categories will be excluded from the sitemap.\";i:5309;s:83:\"Use page slugs or page IDs, seperated by commas, to exclude pages from the sitemap.\";i:5310;s:18:\"Create RSS Sitemap\";i:5311;s:16:\"Schedule Updates\";i:5312;s:11:\"No Schedule\";i:5313;s:22:\"Enable Sitemap Indexes\";i:5314;s:30:\"Maximum Posts Per Sitemap Page\";i:5315;s:10:\"Post Types\";i:5316;s:26:\"Include Date Archive Pages\";i:5317;s:20:\"Include Author Pages\";i:5318;s:14:\"Exclude Images\";i:5319;s:25:\"Create Compressed Sitemap\";i:5320;s:28:\"Link From Virtual Robots.txt\";