i:5526;s:54:\"Help translate All in One SEO Pack into your language.\";i:5527;s:39:\"Beginners Guide for All in One SEO Pack\";i:5528;s:38:\"Beginners Guide for XML Sitemap module\";i:5529;s:38:\"Beginners Guide for Social Meta module\";i:5530;s:25:\"Tips for good on-page SEO\";i:5531;s:50:\"Quality guidelines for SEO titles and descriptions\";i:5532;s:31:\"Submit an XML Sitemap to Google\";i:5533;s:23:\"Set up Google Analytics\";i:5534;s:13:\"Did You Know?\";i:5535;s:59:\"We have complete documentation on every setting and feature\";i:5536;s:56:\"Access to video tutorials about SEO with the Pro version\";i:5537;s:74:\"Control SEO on categories, tags and custom taxonomies with the Pro version\";i:5538;s:32:\"Continue to the General Settings\";i:5539;s:15:\"Import SEO Data\";i:5540;s:15:\"SEO Data Import\";i:5541;s:86:\"Sorry, you can\\\'t do that. Please choose a platform and then click Analyze or Convert.\";i:5542;s:16:\"Analysis Results\";i:5543;s:45:\"Sorry, something went wrong. Please try again\";i:5544;s:57:\"<p>Analyzing records in a %1$s to %2$s conversion&hellip;\";i:5545;s:16:\"Compatible data:\";i:5546;s:18:\"Conversion Results\";i:5547;s:19:\"Import SEO Settings\";i:5548;s:89:\"Use the drop down below to choose which plugin or theme you wish to import SEO data from.\";i:5549;s:141:\"Click \"Analyze\" for a list of SEO data that can be imported into All in One SEO Pack, along with the number of records that will be imported.\";i:5550;s:13:\"Please Note: \";i:5551;s:341:\"Some plugins and themes do not share similar data, or they store data in a non-standard way. If we cannot import this data, it will remain unchanged in your database. Any compatible SEO data will be displayed for you to review. If a post or page already has SEO data in All in One SEO Pack, we will not import data from another plugin/theme.\";i:5552;s:194:\"Click \"Convert\" to perform the import. After the import has completed, you will be alerted to how many records were imported, and how many records had to be ignored, based on the criteria above.\";i:5553;s:21:\"Import SEO data from:\";i:5554;s:16:\"Choose platform:\";i:5555;s:7:\"Plugins\";i:5556;s:6:\"Themes\";i:5557;s:7:\"Analyze\";i:5558;s:7:\"Convert\";i:5559;s:23:\"Method %s doesn\'t exist\";i:5560;s:26:\"Failed to write file %s!\\n\";i:5561;s:25:\"File %s isn\'t writable!\\n\";i:5562;s:27:\"Failed to delete file %s!\\n\";i:5563;s:24:\"File %s doesn\'t exist!\\n\";i:5564;s:27:\"Failed to rename file %s!\\n\";i:5565;s:25:\"File %s already exists!\\n\";i:5566;s:14:\"Update Options\";i:5567;s:29:\"Reset %s Settings to Defaults\";i:5568;s:116:\"Your PHP version is too old, please upgrade to a newer version. Your version is %1$s, Breadcrumb NavXT requires %2$s\";i:5569;s:33:\"Breadcrumb NavXT Network Settings\";i:5570;s:39:\"Adds a breadcrumb trail to your sidebar\";i:5571;s:30:\"Text to show before the trail:\";i:5572;s:16:\"Output trail as:\";i:5573;s:4:\"List\";i:5574;s:32:\"Schema.org BreadcrumbList (RDFa)\";i:5575;s:37:\"Schema.org BreadcrumbList (microdata)\";i:5576;s:5:\"Plain\";i:5577;s:20:\"Link the breadcrumbs\";i:5578;s:30:\"Reverse the order of the trail\";i:5579;s:32:\"Hide the trail on the front page\";i:5580;s:23:\"Ignore breadcrumb cache\";i:5581;s:11:\"Quick Start\";i:5582;s:7:\"Styling\";i:5583;s:19:\"Import/Export/Reset\";i:5584;s:61:\"Go to the guide on trimming breadcrumb title lengths with CSS\";i:5585;s:79:\"A collection of settings most likely to be modified are located under this tab.\";i:5586;s:34:\"Placed in between each breadcrumb.\";i:5587;s:12:\"Current Item\";i:5588;s:46:\"Place the page number breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:5589;s:89:\"Indicates that the user is on a page other than the first of a paginated archive or post.\";i:5590;s:35:\"The template for paged breadcrumbs.\";i:5591;s:15:\"Home Breadcrumb\";i:5592;s:39:\"Place the home breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:5593;s:37:\"The template for the home breadcrumb.\";i:5594;s:77:\"The template for the home breadcrumb, used when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5595;s:15:\"Blog Breadcrumb\";i:5596;s:39:\"Place the blog breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:5597;s:19:\"Mainsite Breadcrumb\";i:5598;s:71:\"Place the main site home breadcrumb in the trail in an multisite setup.\";i:5599;s:84:\"The template for the main site home breadcrumb, used only in multisite environments.\";i:5600;s:122:\"The template for the main site home breadcrumb, used only in multisite environments and when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5601;s:97:\"The settings for all post types (Posts, Pages, and Custom Post Types) are located under this tab.\";i:5602;s:34:\"The template for post breadcrumbs.\";i:5603;s:79:\"The template for post breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5604;s:79:\"Show the hierarchy (specified below) leading to a post in the breadcrumb trail.\";i:5605;s:137:\"Use the parent of the post as the primary hierarchy, falling back to the hierarchy selected below when the parent hierarchy is exhausted.\";i:5606;s:78:\"Allow the referring page to influence the taxonomy selected for the hierarchy.\";i:5607;s:14:\"Post Hierarchy\";i:5608;s:11:\"Post Parent\";i:5609;s:5:\"Pages\";i:5610;s:34:\"The template for page breadcrumbs.\";i:5611;s:79:\"The template for page breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5612;s:11:\"Attachments\";i:5613;s:40:\"The template for attachment breadcrumbs.\";i:5614;s:85:\"The template for attachment breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5615;s:22:\"&mdash; Select &mdash;\";i:5616;s:111:\"The settings for all taxonomies (including Categories, Tags, and custom taxonomies) are located under this tab.\";i:5617;s:38:\"The template for category breadcrumbs.\";i:5618;s:83:\"The template for category breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5619;s:33:\"The template for tag breadcrumbs.\";i:5620;s:78:\"The template for tag breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:5621;s:12:\"