:6681;s:31:\"Add the [pms-account] shortcode\";i:6682;s:9:\"Show Tabs\";i:6683;s:9:\"PMS Login\";i:6684;s:51:\"Create a login form using the [pms-login] shortcode\";i:6685;s:24:\"After Login redirect URL\";i:6686;s:78:\"Enter the URL where users should be redirected after logging in. %sRead more%s\";i:6687;s:25:\"After Logout redirect URL\";i:6688;s:79:\"Enter the URL where users should be redirected after logging out. %sRead more%s\";i:6689;s:20:\"PMS Recover Password\";i:6690;s:57:\"Add a password recovery form using [pms-recover-password]\";i:6691;s:27:\"After recovery redirect URL\";i:6692;s:94:\"Enter the URL where users should be redirected after a sucessful password reset. %sRead more%s\";i:6693;s:60:\"Module for adding the [pms-register] shortcode in your page.\";i:6694;s:68:\"Module for adding the [pms-recover-password] shortcode in your page.\";i:6695;s:59:\"Module for adding the [pms-account] shortcode in your page.\";i:6696;s:57:\"Module for adding the [pms-login] shortcode in your page.\";i:6697;s:24:\"After login redirect URL\";i:6698;s:25:\"After logout redirect URL\";i:6699;s:17:\"Subscription Name\";i:6700;s:19:\"Subscription Status\";i:6701;s:23:\"Subscription Start Date\";i:6702;s:28:\"Subscription Expiration Date\";i:6703;s:35:\"Subscription Plans on Register Form\";i:6704;s:82:\"It looks like there are no active subscriptions. <a href=\"%s\">Create one here</a>.\";i:6705;s:40:\"Widget for the [pms-register] shortcode.\";i:6706;s:13:\"Selected Plan\";i:6707;s:48:\"Widget for the [pms-recover-password] shortcode.\";i:6708;s:30:\"Successfull reset redirect URL\";i:6709;s:39:\"Widget for the [pms-account] shortcode.\";i:6710;s:9:\"Show tabs\";i:6711;s:37:\"Widget for the [pms-login] shortcode.\";i:6712;s:18:\"Login redirect URL\";i:6713;s:19:\"Logout redirect URL\";i:6714;s:49:\"Create member only forums with just a few clicks.\";i:6715;s:103:\"Allow only members to have access to forums and topics with Paid Member Subscriptions\'s bbPress Add-On.\"