 a specific date.\";i:6756;s:202:\"The <strong>Pay What You Want</strong> add-on lets you accept <strong>donations</strong> or let subscribers pay what they want by offering a variable pricing option when they purchase a membership plan.\";i:6757;s:70:\"You do not have access to this content. You need to create an account.\";i:6758;s:73:\"You do not have access to this content. You need the proper subscription.\";i:6759;s:24:\"Please enter a username.\";i:6760;s:58:\"This username is already taken. Please choose another one.\";i:6761;s:31:\"Please enter an e-mail address.\";i:6762;s:45:\"The e-mail address doesn\\\'t seem to be valid.\";i:6763;s:61:\"This e-mail is already registered. Please choose another one.\";i:6764;s:24:\"Please enter a password.\";i:6765;s:27:\"Please repeat the password.\";i:6766;s:28:\"The passwords did not match.\";i:6767;s:61:\"The selected subscription plan does not exist or is inactive.\";i:6768;s:34:\"Please select a subscription plan.\";i:6769;s:21:\"Something went wrong.\";i:6770;s:40:\"You are not eligible to subscribe to: %s\";i:6771;s:10:\"Username *\";i:6772;s:8:\"E-mail *\";i:6773;s:10:\"Password *\";i:6774;s:17:\"Repeat Password *\";i:6775;s:31:\"Please enter your new password.\";i:6776;s:12:\"Subscription\";i:6777;s:7:\"Expires\";i:6778;s:5:\"Trial\";i:6779;s:12:\"Expired on: \";i:6780;s:12:\"View Details\";i:6781;s:17:\"Subscription Plan\";i:6782;s:14:\"Trial End Date\";i:6783;s:12:\"Next Payment\";i:6784;s:5:\"Renew\";i:6785;s:13:\"Retry payment\";i:6786;s:7:\"Abandon\";i:6787;s:12:\"Edit Profile\";i:6788;s:6:\"Amount\";i:6789;s:11:\"Date / Time\";i:6790;s:17:\"No payments found\";i:6791;s:60:\"Congratulations, your account has been successfully created.\";i:6792;s:47:\"Only registered users can see this information.\";i:6793;s:13:\"Subscriptions\";i:6794;s:59:\"You do not have any subscriptions attached to your account.\";i:6795;s:51:\"To purchase a subscription, you can %sclick here%s.\";i:6796;s:47:\"You must be logged in to view this information.\";i:6797;s:8:\"Canceled\";i:6798;s:84:\"Thank you for upgrading. The changes will take effect after the payment is received.\";i:6799;s:83:\"Thank you for renewing. The changes will take effect after the payment is received.\";i:6800;s:92:\"Thank you for subscribing. The subscription will be activated after the payment is received.\";i:6801;s:65:\"The subscription will be activated after the payment is received.\";i:6802;s:21:\"PayPal E-mail Address\";i:6803;s:14:\"Manual/Offline\";i:6804;s:15:\"PayPal Standard\";i:6805;s:25:\"Test payments are enabled\";i:6806;s:25:\"Live payments are enabled\";i:6807;s:7:\"E-Mails\";i:6808;s:93:\"Payment successfully added. The subscription was also added or updated for the selected user.\";i:6809;s:15:\"Expiration date\";i:6810;s:13:\"Auto-renewing\";i:6811;s:18:\"Not Found - ID: %s\";i:6812;s:24:\"Edit Member Subscription\";i:6813;s:23:\"Add Member Subscription\";i:6814;s:19:\"Update Subscription\";i:6815;s:16:\"Add Subscription\";i:6816;s:19:\"Delete Subscription\";i:6817;s:6:\"Member\";i:6818;s:9:\"Select...\";i:6819;s:116:\"Select the username you wish to associate a subscription plan with. You can create a new user <a href=\"%s\">here</a>.\";i:6820;s:22:\"View all subscriptions\";i:6821;s:20:\"Subscription Details\";i:6822;s:9:\"Trial End\";i:6823;s:29:\"Subscription Billing Schedule\";i:6824;s:31:\"Payment Gateway Subscription ID\";i:6825;s:68:\"The subscription payment schedule is handled by the payment gateway.\";i:6826;s:20:\"Recurring Once Every\";i:6827;s:6:\"Day(s)\";i:6828;s:7:\"Week(s)\";i:6829;s:8:\"Month(s)\";i:6830;s:7:\"Year(s)\";i:6831;s:15:\"Payment Gateway\";i:6832;s:11:\"Payment #%s\";i:6833;s:15:\"Add New Payment\";i:6834;s:104:\"Select the username you wish to assign this payment to. You can create a new user <a href=\"%s\">here</a>.\";i:6835;s:11:\"Amount (%s)\";i:6836;s:13:\"Discount Code\";i:6837;s:14:\"Transaction ID\";i:6838;s:110:\"The Transaction ID will be provided by the payment gateway when the payment is registered within their system.\";i:6839;s:10:\"IP Address\";i:6840;s:12:\"Save Payment\";i:6841;s:11:\"Add Payment\";i:6842;s:12:\"Bulk Add New\";i:6843;s:11:\"Edit Member\";i:6844;s:15:\"Recent Payments\";i:6845;s:7:\"Reports\";i:6846;s:14:\"Members Export\";i:6847;s:125:\"Download a CSV with your user subscriptions (an user with multiple subscriptions will have a record for each individual one).\";i:6848;s:17:\"All Subscriptions\";i:6849;s:46:\"Choose the Subscription to export members from\";i:6850;s:11:\"All Members\";i:6851;s:38:\"Choose the current subscription status\";i:6852;s:12:\"Generate CSV\";i:6853;s:15:\"Payments Export\";i:6854;s:34:\"Download a CSV with your payments.\";i:6855;s:12:\"All Payments\";i:6856;s:25:\"Choose the payment status\";i:6857;s:8:\"End Date\";i:6858;s:48:\"Leave dates empty for an export of all payments.\";i:6859;s:36:\"Bulk Add Subscription Plans to Users\";i:6860;s:6:\"Filter\";i:6861;s:13:\"Member Emails\";i:6862;s:21:\"General Email Options\";i:6863;s:9:\"From Name\";i:6864;s:10:\"From Email\";i:6865;s:83:\"You can <a href=\"%s\">customize this email</a> with Profile Builder Email Customizer\";i:6866;s:27:\"Enable Administrator Emails\";i:6867;s:25:\"Send Administrator Emails\";i:6868;s:57:\"By checking this option administrator emails are enabled.\";i:6869;s:122:\"Add a list of email addresses, separated by comma, that you wish to receive emails for member subscription status changes.\";i:6870;s:9:\"Test Mode\";i:6871;s:157:\"By checking this option you will be able to use Paid Member Subscriptions only with test accounts from your payment processors. <a href=\"%s\">More Details</a>\";i:6872;s:92:\"Select your currency. Please note that some payment gateways can have currency restrictions.\";i:6873;s:6:\"Before\";i:6874;s:5:\"After\";i:6875;s:85:\"Select whether the currency symbol should appear before the price or after the price.\";i:6876;s:23:\"Default Payment Gateway\";i:6877;s:7:\"Renewal\";i:6878;s:38:\"Customer opts in for automatic renewal\";i:6879;s:26:\"Always renew automatically\";i:6880;s:25:\"Never renew automatically\";i:6881;s:92:\"Select renewal type. You can either allow the customer to opt in or force automatic renewal.\";i:6882;s:8:\"Load CSS\";i:6883;s:58:\"Use Paid Member Subscriptions\\\'s own CSS in the front-end.\";i:6884;s:79:\"Select \"Yes\" to automatically log in new members after successful registration.\";i:6885;s:21:\"Register Success Page\";i:6886;s:73:\"Select the page where you wish to redirect your newly registered members.\";i:6887;s:122:\"By checking this option you will be able to use Paid Member Subscriptions with test accounts from your payment processors.\";i:6888;s:8:\"Template\";i:6889;s:103:\"If you select \"Messages\" the post\\\'s content will be protected by being replaced with a custom message.\";i:6890;s:250:\"If you select \"Redirect\" the post\\\'s content will be protected by redirecting the user to the URL you specify. The redirect happens only when accessing a single post. On archive pages the restriction message will be displayed, instead of the content.\";i:6891;s:146:\"If you select \"Template\" the template for the restricted post/page will change to the selected template in the Restriction Template section below.\";i:6892;s:20:\"Restriction Redirect\";i:6893;s:39:\"Messages for logged-in non-member users\";i:6894;s:20:\"Restriction Template\";i:6895;s:133:\"Select which template should load instead of the default one when a post is restricted and the restriction type is set to \"Template\".\";i:6896;s:101:\"Show a portion of the restricted post to logged-out users or users that are not subscribed to a plan.\";i:6897;s:111:\"By checking this option the administrator email addresses from the field below wil receive email notifications.\";i:6898;s:129:\"Please add a list of email addresses, separated by comma, that you wish to receive emails for member subscription status changes.\";i:6899;s:21:\"Activate your licence\";i:6900;s:13:\"Serial number\";i:6901;s:94:\"The serial number is used to access the premium add-ons, any updates made to them and support.\";i:6902;s:213:\"Translate your Paid Member Subscriptions checkout with a WordPress translation plugin that anyone can use. It offers a simpler way to translate WordPress sites, with full support for WooCommerce and site builders.\";i:6903;s:42:\"Compatible with Paid Member Subscriptions.\";i:6904;s:192:\"Capture more user information on the registration form with the help of Profile Builder\'s custom user profile fields and/or add an Email Confirmation process to verify your customers accounts.\";i:6905;s:86:\"The paid add-ons can be downloaded from your <a href=\"%s\">Cozmoslabs Account</a> page.\";i:6906;s:4:\"New!\";i:6907;s:14:\"Available in: \";i:6908;s:7:\"version\";i:6909;s:58:\"Compatible with your version of Paid Member Subscriptions.\";i:6910;s:33:\"Upgrade Paid Member Subscriptions\";i:6911;s:45:\"Not compatible with Paid Member Subscriptions\";i:6912;s:62:\"Not compatible with your version of Paid Member Subscriptions.\";i:6913;s:51:\"Minimum required Paid Member Subscriptions version:\";i:6914;s:17:\"Restrict Comments\";i:6915;s:51:\"Restrict replying, but allow users to view comments\";i:6916;s:19:\"Restrict everything\";i:6917;s:38:\"Restrict comments if they are enabled.\";i:6918;s:42:\"<strong>Paid Member Subscriptions</strong>\";i:6919;s:80:\"Accept payments, create subscription plans and restrict content on your website.\";i:6920;s:20:\"Membership Made Easy\";i:6921;s:102:\"Add basic registration forms where members can sign-up for a subscription plan using the %s shortcode.\";i:6922;s:107:\"Allow members to edit their account information and manage their subscription plans using the %s shortcode.\";i:6923;s:84:\"Restrict content using the %s shortcode or directly from individual posts and pages.\";i:6924;s:108:\"Output subscription plans form anywhere and allow users to sign up for new subscriptions using %s shortcode.\";i:6925;s:42:\"Allow members to login using %s shortcode.\";i:6926;s:64:\"Add a recover password form for your members using %s shortcode.\";i:6927;s:18:\"Membership Modules\";i:6928;s:52:\"Powerful sections that help you manage your members.\";i:6929;s:182:\"Create hierarchical subscription plans allowing your members to upgrade from an existing subscription. Shortcode based, offering many options to customize your subscriptions listing.\";i:6930;s:7:\"Members\";i:6931;s:121:\"Overview of all your members and their subscription plans. Easily add/remove members or edit their subscription details. \";i:6932;s:84:\"Keep track of all member payments, payment statuses or purchased subscription plans.\";i:6933;s:194:\"Set the payment gateway used to accept payments, select messages seen by users when accessing a restricted content page or customize default member emails. Everything is just a few clicks away. \";i:6934;s:68:\"Integrates beautifully with WooCommerce, for extended functionality.\";i:6935;s:37:\"Restrict Product Viewing & Purchasing\";i:6936;s:152:\"Control who can see or purchase a WooCommerce product based on logged in status and subscription plan. Easily create products available to members only.\";i:6937;s:26:\"Offer Membership Discounts\";i:6938;s:145:\"Offer product discounts to members based on their active subscription. Set discounts globally per subscription plan, or individually per product.\";i:6939;s:178:\"Make use of the extra flexibility by setting custom restriction messages per product, excluding products on sale from membership discounts, allowing cumulative discounts & more. \";i:6940;s:16:\"Featured Add-ons\";i:6941;s:109:\"Get more functionality by using dedicated Add-ons and tailor Paid Member Subscriptions to your project needs.\";i:6942;s:13:\"Basic Add-ons\";i:6943;s:123:\"These addons extend your WordPress Membership Plugin and are available with the <a href=\"%s\">Hobbyist and PRO</a> versions.\";i:6944;s:26:\"Global Content Restriction\";i:6945;s:111:\"Easy way to add global content restriction rules to subscription plans, based on post type, taxonomy and terms.\";i:6946;s:14:\"Discount Codes\";i:6947;s:116:\"Friction-less discount code creation for running promotions, making price reductions or simply rewarding your users.\";i:6948;s:15:\"Email Reminders\";i:6949;s:160:\"Create multiple automated email reminders that are sent to members before or after certain events take place (subscription expires, subscription activated etc.)\";i:6950;s:25:\"Navigation Menu Filtering\";i:6951;s:96:\"Dynamically display menu items based on logged-in status as well as selected subscription plans.\";i:6952;s:7:\"bbPress\";i:6953;s:76:\"Integrate Paid Member Subscriptions with the popular forums plugin, bbPress.\";i:6954;s:23:\"Fixed Period Membership\";i:6955;s:17:\"Get Basic Add-ons\";i:6956;s:11:\"Pro Add-ons\";i:6957;s:114:\"These addons extend your WordPress Membership Plugin and are available with the <a href=\"%s\">PRO version</a> only.\";i:6958;s:36:\"Recurring Payments - PayPal Standard\";i:6959;s:68:\"Accept recurring payments from your members through PayPal Standard.\";i:6960;s:29:\"PayPal Pro and PayPal Express\";i:6961;s:95:\"Accept one time or recurring payments through PayPal Pro (credit card) and/or Express Checkout.\";i:6962;s:6:\"Stripe\";i:6963;s:94:\"Accept credit card payments, both one-time and recurring, directly on your website via Stripe.\";i:6964;s:16:\"Content Dripping\";i:6965;s:171:\"Create schedules for your content, making posts or categories available for your members only after a certain time has passed since they signed up for a subscription plan.\";i:6966;s:29:\"Multiple Subscriptions / User\";i:6967;s:122:\"Setup multiple subscription level blocks and allow members to sign up for more than one subscription plan (one per block).\";i:6968;s:8:\"Invoices\";i:6969;s:106:\"This add-on allows you and your members to download PDF invoices for each payment that has been completed.\";i:6970;s:15:\"Get Pro Add-ons\";i:6971;s:95:\"Paid Member Subscriptions comes with an <a href=\"%s\">extensive documentation</a> to assist you.\";i:6972;s:35:\"Uninstall Paid Member Subscriptions\";i:6973;s:96:\"We\\\'re sad to see you leave, but we understand that sometimes things don\\\'t work out as planned.\";i:6974;s:153:\"Below you have information about what will be removed from your database. Please be advised that once this information is removed it cannot be recovered.\";i:6975;s:14:\"Custom Options\";i:6976;s:111:\"Removes all custom options, used by Paid Member Subscriptions, from the <em>options</em> table of the database.\";i:6977;s:17:\"Custom User Roles\";i:6978;s:130:\"Removes all custom user roles created by Paid Member Subscriptions. These user roles will be removed for all users that have them.\";i:6979;s:22:\"Custom Database Tables\";i:6980;s:105:\"Removes all information stored in our custom database tables and deletes these tables from your database.\";i:6981;s:17:\"Confirm Uninstall\";i:6982;s:133:\"To confirm the Uninstall process please type the word <strong>REMOVE</strong> in the field below and then click the Uninstall button.\";i:6983;s:23:\"Prevent Account Sharing\";i:6984;s:96:\"Prevent users from being logged in with the same account from multiple places at the same time. \";i:6985;s:200:\"If the current user\\\'s session has been taken over by a newer session, we will log him out and he will have to login again. This will make it inconvenient for members to share their login credentials.\";i:6986;s:32:\"Redirect Default WordPress Pages\";i:6987;s:160:\"Redirect users from the default WordPress login ( wp-login.php ), register and lost password forms to the front-end ones created with Paid Member Subscriptions.\";i:6988;s:16:\"Membership Pages\";i:6989;s:87:\"These pages need to be set so that Paid Member Subscriptions knows where to send users.\";i:6990;s:10:\"Login Page\";i:6991;s:70:\"Select the page containing the <strong>[pms-login]</strong> shortcode.\";i:6992;s:13:\"Register Page\";i:6993;s:73:\"Select the page containing the <strong>[pms-register]</strong> shortcode.\";i:6994;s:12:\"Account Page\";i:6995;s:72:\"Select the page containing the <strong>[pms-account]</strong> shortcode.\";i:6996;s:18:\"Lost Password Page\";i:6997;s:81:\"Select the page containing the <strong>[pms-recover-password]</strong> shortcode.\";i:6998;s:42:\"Paid Member Subscriptions Payments Summary\";i:6999;s:17:\"Write description\";i:7000;s:86:\"A description for this subscription plan. This will be displayed on the register form.\";i:7001;s:8:\"Duration\";i:7002;s:53:\"Set the subscription duration. Leave 0 for unlimited.\";i:7003;s:5:\"Price\";i:7004;s:94:\"Amount you want to charge people who join this plan. Leave 0 if you want this plan to be free.\";i:7005;s:11:\"Sign-up Fee\";i:7006;s:71:\"Amount you want to charge people upfront when subscribing to this plan.\";i:7007;s:10:\"Free Trial\";i:7008;s:143:\"The free trial represents the amount of time before charging the first recurring payment. The sign-up fee applies regardless of the free trial.\";i:7009;s:16:\"Settings default\";i:7010;s:110:\"Select renewal type. You can either allow the customer to opt in, force automatic renewal or force no renewal.\";i:7011;s:61:\"Only active subscription plans will be displayed to the user.\";i:7012;s:9:\"User role\";i:7013;s:52:\"... Create new user role from this Subscription Plan\";i:7014;s:64:\"Select which user role to associate with this subscription plan.\";i:7015;s:13:\"Current Month\";i:7016;s:7:\"Income:\";i:7017;s:9:\"Payments:\";i:7018;s:17:\"View All Payments\";i:7019;s:18:\"No payments found.\";i:7020;s:106:\"Checking only \"Logged In Users\" will show this %s to all logged in users, regardless of subscription plan.\";i:7021;s:109:\"Checking any subscription plan will show this %s only to users that are subscribed to those particular plans.\";i:7022;s:25:\"Subscription Plan Details\";i:7023;s:13:\"Subscribed to\";i:7024;s:36:\"Export location or file not writable\";i:7025;s:35:\"No data found for export parameters\";i:7026;s:42:\"You do not have permission to export data.\";i:7027;s:27:\"Select Subscription Plan...\";i:7028;s:6:\"Assign\";i:7029;s:53:\"Something went wrong. Could not process your request.\";i:7030;s:39:\"Member Subscription added successfully.\";i:7031;s:41:\"Member Subscription updated successfully.\";i:7032;s:41:\"Member Subscription deleted successfully.\";i:7033;s:53:\"This content is restricted for your membership level.\";i:7034;s:11:\"Get Support\";i:7035;s:111:\"bbPress needs to be installed and activated for Paid Member Subscriptions - bbPress Add-on to work as expected!\";i:7036;s:40:\"Active <span class=\\\"count\\\">(%s)</span>\";i:7037;s:42:\"Inactive <span class=\\\"count\\\">(%s)</span>\";i:7038;s:41:\"Expired <span class=\\\"count\\\">(%s)</span>\";i:7039;s:4:\"Uses\";i:7040;s:13:\"No start date\";i:7041;s:18:\"No expiration date\";i:7042;s:15:\"Delete Discount\";i:7043;s:29:\"Enter Discount Code name here\";i:7044;s:22:\"Discount Code updated.\";i:7045;s:20:\"Discount Code saved.\";i:7046;s:24:\"Discount Code submitted.\";i:7047;s:28:\"Discount Code draft updated.\";i:7048;s:25:\"%s Discount Code updated.\";i:7049;s:26:\"%s Discount Codes updated.\";i:7050;s:53:\"%s Discount Code not updated, somebody is editing it.\";i:7051;s:56:\"%s Discount Codes not updated, somebody is editing them.\";i:7052;s:37:\"%s Discount Code permanently deleted.\";i:7053;s:38:\"%s Discount Codes permanently deleted.\";i:7054;s:36:\"%s Discount Code moved to the Trash.\";i:7055;s:37:\"%s Discount Codes moved to the Trash.\";i:7056;s:41:\"%s Discount Code restored from the Trash.\";i:7057;s:42:\"%s Discount Codes restored from the Trash.\";i:7058;s:78:\"The promotion code you entered already exists. Please choose a different code.\";i:7059;s:37:\"Amount needs to be a positive number.\";i:7060;s:44:\"Maximum uses needs to be a positive integer.\";i:7061;s:62:\"Maximum discount uses per user needs to be a positive integer.\";i:7062;s:69:\"Please enter a valid discount start date in the format of yyyy-mm-dd.\";i:7063;s:80:\"The discount code has already expired. Please enter a different expiration date.\";i:7064;s:74:\"Please enter a valid discount expiration date in the format of yyyy-mm-dd.\";i:7065;s:21:\"Discount Code Details\";i:7066;s:15:\"Discount Code: \";i:7067;s:14:\"Enter discount\";i:7068;s:38:\"Applying discount code. Please wait...\";i:7069;s:31:\"Discount successfully applied! \";i:7070;s:7:\"%s days\";i:7071;s:8:\"%s weeks\";i:7072;s:9:\"%s months\";i:7073;s:4:\"year\";i:7074;s:8:\"%s years\";i:7075;s:6:\"%s day\";i:7076;s:7:\"%s week\";i:7077;s:8:\"%s month\";i:7078;s:7:\"%s year\";i:7079;s:10:\" after %s \";i:7080;s:9:\" %s is %s\";i:7081;s:21:\"now is %s, then %s %s\";i:7082;s:6:\" is %s\";i:7083;s:10:\" every %s.\";i:7084;s:22:\", then %s %s every %s.\";i:7085;s:21:\"Amount to be charged \";i:7086;s:48:\"Please select a subscription plan and try again.\";i:7087;s:53:\"The discount is not valid for this subscription plan.\";i:7088;s:48:\"The discount code you entered is not active yet.\";i:7089;s:42:\"The discount code you entered has expired.\";i:7090;s:49:\"The discount code maximum uses have been reached.\";i:7091;s:63:\"The discount code maximum uses for this user have been reached.\";i:7092;s:41:\"The discount code you entered is invalid.\";i:7093;s:19:\"Choose a post type.\";i:7094;s:12:\"Add Taxonomy\";i:7095;s:16:\"Remove this rule\";i:7096;s:10:\"Display To\";i:7097;s:16:\"Logged Out Users\";i:7098;s:8:\"Everyone\";i:7099;s:38:\"Limit logged in users to Subscriptions\";i:7100;s:14:\"Register Email\";i:7101;s:27:\"Activate Subscription Email\";i:7102;s:25:\"Cancel Subscription Email\";i:7103;s:26:\"Expired Subscription Email\";i:7104;s:22:\"You have a new account\";i:7105;s:31:\"Your Subscription is now active\";i:7106;s:35:\"Your Subscription has been canceled\";i:7107;s:29:\"Your Subscription has expired\";i:7108;s:41:\"A New User has registered to your website\";i:7109;s:35:\"A Member Subscription is now active\";i:7110;s:39:\"A Member Subscription has been canceled\";i:7111;s:33:\"A Member Subscription has expired\";i:7112;s:75:\"Congratulations {{display_name}}! You have successfully created an account!\";i:7113;s:101:\"Congratulations {{display_name}}! The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has been successfully activated.\";i:7114;s:77:\"Hello {{display_name}}, The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has been canceled.\";i:7115;s:70:\"Hello {{display_name}},The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has expired.\";i:7116;s:45:\"{{display_name}} has just created an account!\";i:7117;s:93:\"The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has been successfully activated for user {{display_name}}.\";i:7118;s:79:\"The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has been canceled for user {{display_name}}.\";i:7119;s:73:\"The \\\"{{subscription_name}}\\\" plan has expired for user {{display_name}}.\";i:7120;s:44:\"The e-mail address doesn\'t seem to be valid.\";i:7121;s:40:\"There was no subscription plan selected.\";i:7122;s:71:\"There is no payment gateway available to complete the checkout process.\";i:7123;s:80:\"Something went wrong. The selected payment gateway does not support free trials.\";i:7124;s:81:\"Something went wrong. The selected payment gateway does not support sign-up fees.\";i:7125;s:87:\"Something went wrong. The selected payment gateway does not support recurring payments.\";i:7126;s:25:\"You are already a member.\";i:7127;s:49:\"Your subscription has been successfully canceled.\";i:7128;s:60:\"Something went wrong. We could not cancel your subscription.\";i:7129;s:48:\"Your subscription has been successfully removed.\";i:7130;s:60:\"Something went wrong. We could not remove your subscription.\";i:7131;s:58:\"Congratulations, you have successfully created an account.\";i:7132;s:41:\"Please enter a username or email address.\";i:7133;s:53:\"The entered username doesn\'t exist. Please try again.\";i:7134;s:65:\"The entered email wasn\'t found in our database. Please try again.\";i:7135;s:222:\"Someone requested that the password be reset for the following account: <b>%1$s</b><br/><br/>If this was a mistake, just ignore this email and nothing will happen.<br/>To reset your password, visit the following link: %2$s\";i:7136;s:26:\"Password Reset from \\\"%s\\\"\";i:7137;s:60:\"There was an error while trying to send the activation link.\";i:7138;s:52:\"The entered passwords don\'t match! Please try again.\";i:7139;s:46:\"Some of the characters entered were not valid.\";i:7140;s:28:\"Profile updated successfully\";i:7141;s:55:\"Something went wrong. We could not update your profile.\";i:7142;s:34:\"You are currently logged in as %s.\";i:7143;s:8:\"Log out.\";i:7144;s:50:\"Please check your email for the confirmation link.\";i:7145;s:26:\"You are already logged in.\";i:7146;s:39:\"Your password was successfully changed!\";i:7147;s:42:\"You will soon be redirected automatically.\";i:7148;s:47:\"The confirmation link has expired. Invalid key.\";i:7149;s:20:\"Test Publishable Key\";i:7150;s:15:\"Test Secret Key\";i:7151;s:20:\"Live Publishable Key\";i:7152;s:15:\"Live Secret Key\";i:7153;s:22:\"Reference Transactions\";i:7154;s:116:\"Check if your PayPal account has Reference Transactions enabled. %1$sLearn how to enable reference transactions.%2$s\";i:7155;s:12:\"API Username\";i:7156;s:26:\"API Username for Live site\";i:7157;s:12:\"API Password\";i:7158;s:26:\"API Password for Live site\";i:7159;s:13:\"API Signature\";i:7160;s:27:\"API Signature for Live site\";i:7161;s:17:\"Test API Username\";i:7162;s:34:\"API Username for Test/Sandbox site\";i:7163;s:17:\"Test API Password\";i:7164;s:34:\"API Password for Test/Sandbox site\";i:7165;s:18:\"Test API Signature\";i:7166;s:35:\"API Signature for Test/Sandbox site\";i:7167;s:137:\"Your <strong>Invoices</strong> add-on version is not 100% compatible with this version of <strong>Paid Member Subscriptions</strong>.<br>\";i:7168;s:256:\"Your licence is currently <strong>expired</strong>, you need to <a href=\\\"%s\\\">renew</a> your licence to get access to the latest updates. After renewal, go to the <a href=\\\"%s\\\">plugins</a> page to <strong>update the add-on to the latest version</strong>.\";i:7169;s:109:\"Please go to the <a href=\\\"%s\\\">plugins</a> page to <strong>update the add-on to the latest version</strong>.\";i:7170;s:138:\"Your <strong>reCAPTCHA</strong> add-on version is not 100% compatible with this version of <strong>Paid Member Subscriptions</strong>.<br>\";i:7171;s:186:\"<a href=\\\"%s\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here</a> to download the latest version of the add-on. You can read install instructions on our <a href=\\\"%s\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">documentation</a>.\";i:7172;s:128:\"Something went wrong while trying to process the payment. Your account has been created, so please log in and retry the payment.\";i:7173;s:75:\"Something went wrong while trying to process the payment. Please try again.\";i:7174;s:20:\"Upgrade %1$s to %2$s\";i:7175;s:14:\"Upgrade %s to:\";i:7176;s:20:\"Upgrade Subscription\";i:7177;s:7:\"Go back\";i:7178;s:63:\"Renew %s subscription. The subscription will be active until %s\";i:7179;s:18:\"Renew Subscription\";i:7180;s:128:\"Are you sure you want to cancel your %s subscription? No further payments will be made for this subscription and it will expire.\";i:7181;s:7:\"Confirm\";i:7182;s:118:\"Are you sure you want to abandon your %s subscription? This subscription will be removed completely from your account.\";i:7183;s:20:\"Abandon Subscription\";i:7184;s:72:\"Your %s subscription is still pending. Do you wish to retry the payment?\";i:7185;s:50:\"Comments are restricted for your membership level.\";i:7186;s:43:\"You must be logged in to view the comments.\";i:7187;s:66:\"Congratulations, you have successfully upgraded your subscription.\";i:7188;s:65:\"Congratulations, you have successfully renewed your subscription.\";i:7189;s:65:\"Congratulations, you have successfully subscribed to our website.\";i:7190;s:73:\"Thank you for your payment. The upgrade may take a while to be processed.\";i:7191;s:71:\"Thank you for your payment. The renew may take a while to be processed.\";i:7192;s:79:\"Thank you for your payment. The subscription may take a while to get activated.\";i:7193;s:26:\"Processing. Please wait...\";i:7194;s:14:\"Pound Sterling\";i:7195;s:15:\"Canadian Dollar\";i:7196;s:17:\"Australian Dollar\";i:7197;s:14:\"Brazilian Real\";i:7198;s:18:\"Israeli New Sheqel\";i:7199;s:15:\"Philippine Peso\";i:7200;s:13:\"Russian Ruble\";i:7201;s:12:\"Turkish Lira\";i:7202;s:182:\"Your website doesn\'t seem to have SSL enabled. Some functionality will not work without a valid SSL certificate. Please enable SSL and ensure your server has a valid SSL certificate.\";i:7203;s:16:\" %1$sDismiss%2$s\";i:7204;s:145:\"Your <strong>Paid Member Subscriptions</strong> serial number has <strong>expired</strong>. <a class=\\\"button-primary\\\" href=\\\"%s\\\">Renew now</a>\";i:7205;s:6:\"%s Day\";i:7206;s:7:\"%s Days\";i:7207;s:7:\"%s Week\";i:7208;s:8:\"%s Weeks\";i:7209;s:8:\"%s Month\";i:7210;s:9:\"%s Months\";i:7211;s:7:\"%s Year\";i:7212;s:8:\"%s Years\";i:7213;s:28:\" with a %1$s %2$s free trial\";i:7214;s:23:\" and a %1$s sign-up fee\";i:7215;s:32:\"Automatically renew subscription\";i:7216;s:39:\"You do not have access to this content.\";i:7217;s:24:\"Contents Table Shortcode\";i:7218;s:25:\"Content Drip Set updated.\";i:7219;s:23:\"Content Drip Set saved.\";i:7220;s:27:\"Content Drip Set submitted.\";i:7221;s:31:\"Content Drip Set draft updated.\";i:7222;s:16:\"Content Drip Set\";i:7223;s:17:\"Content Drip Sets\";i:7224;s:24:\"Content Drip Set Details\";i:7225;s:5:\"Delay\";i:7226;s:7:\"By Post\";i:7227;s:13:\"List of Posts\";i:7228;s:11:\"By Taxonomy\";i:7229;s:24:\"Promotion Code / Voucher\";i:7230;s:55:\"Enter the code for the discount. For example: 50percent\";i:7231;s:7:\"Percent\";i:7232;s:12:\"Fixed amount\";i:7233;s:47:\"The type of discount to apply for the purchase.\";i:7234;s:26:\"Enter the discount amount.\";i:7235;s:15:\"Subscription(s)\";i:7236;s:67:\"Select the subscription(s) to which the discount should be applied.\";i:7237;s:94:\"You do not have any active Subscription Plans yet. Please create them <a href=\\\"%s\\\">here</a>.\";i:7238;s:12:\"Maximum Uses\";i:7239;s:87:\"Maximum number of times this discount can be used (by any user). Enter 0 for unlimited.\";i:7240;s:28:\"Limit Discount Uses Per User\";i:7241;s:95:\"Maximum number of times this discount code can be used by the same user. Enter 0 for unlimited.\";i:7242;s:83:\"Select the start date for the discount (yyyy-mm-dd). Leave blank for no start date.\";i:7243;s:88:\"Select the expiration date for the discount (yyyy-mm-dd). Leave blank for no expiration.\";i:7244;s:28:\"Select discount code status.\";i:7245;s:18:\"Recurring Payments\";i:7246;s:73:\"Apply discount to all future recurring payments (not just the first one).\";i:7247;s:7:\"Send To\";i:7248;s:13:\"Trigger Event\";i:7249;s:14:\"Administrators\";i:7250;s:7:\"Hour(s)\";i:7251;s:43:\"after Member Signs Up (subscription active)\";i:7252;s:51:\"after Member Abandons Signup (subscription pending)\";i:7253;s:27:\"before Subscription Expires\";i:7254;s:26:\"after Subscription Expires\";i:7255;s:40:\"before Subscription Renews Automatically\";i:7256;s:16:\"since Last Login\";i:7257;s:30:\"Enter Email Reminder name here\";i:7258;s:23:\"Email Reminder updated.\";i:7259;s:21:\"Email Reminder saved.\";i:7260;s:25:\"Email Reminder submitted.\";i:7261;s:29:\"Email Reminder draft updated.\";i:7262;s:26:\"%s Email Reminder updated.\";i:7263;s:27:\"%s Email Reminders updated.\";i:7264;s:54:\"%s Email Reminder not updated, somebody is editing it.\";i:7265;s:57:\"%s Email Reminders not updated, somebody is editing them.\";i:7266;s:38:\"%s Email Reminder pe