subscription price.\";i:7300;s:14:\"Maximum price:\";i:7301;s:112:\"Enter the maximum price allowed for this subscription plan. Leaving it empty will imply no maximum price is set.\";i:7302;s:6:\"Label:\";i:7303;s:106:\"Text that will be displayed on the front-end, after the subscription plan name and before the price input.\";i:7304;s:56:\"Please enter a price for the selected subscription plan.\";i:7305;s:48:\"Please enter a numeric price, greater than zero.\";i:7306;s:43:\"Please enter a price between %1$s and %2$s.\";i:7307;s:49:\"Please enter a price greater than or equal to %s.\";i:7308;s:46:\"Please enter a price less than or equal to %s.\";i:7309;s:127:\"You will soon be redirected automatically. If you see this page for more than 5 seconds, please click <a href=\\\"%1$s\\\">here</a>\";i:7310;s:52:\"You will soon be redirected to complete the payment.\";i:7311;s:61:\"You are being redirected to PayPal to complete the payment...\";i:7312;s:25:\"%sClick here%s to go now.\";i:7313;s:46:\"Something went wrong when connecting to PayPal\";i:7314;s:47:\"Something went wrong when connecting to PayPal.\";i:7315;s:53:\"PayPal could not generate the needed token. %1$s %2$s\";i:7316;s:29:\"No request response received.\";i:7317;s:23:\"Credit Card Information\";i:7318;s:11:\"Card Number\";i:7319;s:8:\"Card CVV\";i:7320;s:54:\"PayPal subscription creation failed. Please try again.\";i:7321;s:14:\"Error message:\";i:7322;s:11:\"Error code:\";i:7323;s:34:\"Please enter a Billing First Name.\";i:7324;s:33:\"Please enter a Billing Last Name.\";i:7325;s:31:\"Please enter a Billing Address.\";i:7326;s:28:\"Please enter a Billing City.\";i:7327;s:29:\"Please enter a Billing State.\";i:7328;s:31:\"Please enter a Billing Country.\";i:7329;s:32:\"Please enter a Billing ZIP code.\";i:7330;s:33:\"Please enter a valid card number.\";i:7331;s:45:\"Please enter a valid card verification value.\";i:7332;s:42:\"Please enter a valid card expiration date.\";i:7333;s:19:\"Credit / Debit Card