433;s:13:\"Email Content\";i:7434;s:74:\"Enter the email reminder content. You can use the %1$savailable tags%2$s. \";i:7435;s:81:\"You can set the From Name and From Email in under %1$sGeneral Email Options%2$s. \";i:7436;s:71:\"Select the subscription(s) to which this email reminder should be sent.\";i:7437;s:33:\"Select the email reminder status.\";i:7438;s:8:\"E-mail: \";i:7439;s:18:\"Invoice number: %s\";i:7440;s:14:\"Payment ID: %s\";i:7441;s:16:\"Payment date: %s\";i:7442;s:18:\"Payment status: %s\";i:7443;s:19:\"Payment gateway: %s\";i:7444;s:12:\"Provided by:\";i:7445;s:12:\"Provided to:\";i:7446;s:14:\"Total (%s): %s\";i:7447;s:15:\"Invoice Details\";i:7448;s:15:\"Company Details\";i:7449;s:193:\"Enter your company details as you would like them to appear on the invoice. ( Company Name, Address, Country, etc.) <br/> <strong>Note: Company details are required to create invoices.</strong>\";i:7450;s:13:\"Invoice Notes\";i:7451;s:28:\"Thank you for your business!\";i:7452;s:54:\"These notes will appear at the bottom of each invoice.\";i:7453;s:16:\"Invoice Settings\";i:7454;s:128:\"For invoice title and format you can use the following tags: <code>{{number}}</code>, <code>{{MM}}</code>, <code>{{YYYY}}</code>\";i:7455;s:13:\"Invoice Title\";i:7456;s:95:\"Depending on your country fiscal regulations you can change it to things like: Tax Invoice etc.\";i:7457;s:46:\"<strong>Note</strong>: {{number}} is required.\";i:7458;s:21:\"Reset Invoice Counter\";i:7459;s:52:\"Check this if you want to reset the invoice counter.\";i:7460;s:19:\"Next Invoice Number\";i:7461;s:136:\"Enter the next invoice number. Default value is 1 and increments every time an invoice is issued. Existing invoices will not be changed.\";i:7462;s:12:\"Reset Yearly\";i:7463;s:82:\"Automatically reset invoice numbers on new year\'s day. Resets invoice number to 1.\";i:7464;s:17:\"Subscription Type\";i:7465;s:7:\"Regular\";i:7466;s:12:\"Fixed Period\";i:7467;s:59:\"Please select the duration type for this subscription plan.\";i:7468;s:92:\"The date at which member subscriptions associated with this subscription plan should expire.\";i:7469;s:27:\"PayPal Billing Agreement ID\";i:7470;s:54:\"The provided PayPal Billing Agreement ID is not valid.\";i:7471;s:20:\"Payment confirmation\";i:7472;s:9:\"Recurring\";i:7473;s:15:\"For first %d %s\";i:7474;s:16:\"For first %d %ss\";i:7475;s:16:\"Once every %d %s\";i:7476;s:17:\"Once every %d %ss\";i:7477;s:15:\"Confirm payment\";i:7478;s:9:\"reCaptcha\";i:7479;s:32:\"The site key from %1$sGoogle%2$s\";i:7480;s:34:\"The secret key from %1$sGoogle%2$s\";i:7481;s:10:\"Display on\";i:7482;s:13:\"Register Form\";i:7483;s:21:\"Recover Password Form\";i:7484;s:31:\"Default WordPress Register Form\";i:7485;s:28:\"Default WordPress Login Form\";i:7486;s:39:\"Default WordPress Recover Password Form\";i:7487;s:18:\"Stripe Customer ID\";i:7488;s:14:\"Stripe Card ID\";i:7489;s:45:\"The provided Stripe Customer ID is not valid.\";i:7490;s:41:\"The provided Stripe Card ID is not valid.\";i:7491;s:13:\"Card Number *\";i:7492;s:10:\"Card CVV *\";i:7493;s:17:\"Expiration Date *\";i:7494;s:20:\"Billing First Name *\";i:7495;s:19:\"Billing Last Name *\";i:7496;s:17:\"Billing Address *\";i:7497;s:14:\"Billing City *\";i:7498;s:27:\"Billing Zip / Postal Code *\";i:7499;s:17:\"Billing Country *\";i:7500;s:26:\"Billing State / Province *\";i:7501;s:84:\"It looks like there are no active subscriptions. <a href=\\\"%s\\\">Create one here</a>.\";i:7502;s:103:\"Select which Subscription Plans to show to the user on the register forms ( drag and drop to re-order )\";i:7503;s:24:\"Subscription Plans Order\";i:7504;s:71:\"Save the subscription plan order from the subscription plans checkboxes\";i:7505;s:26:\"Selected Subscription Plan\";i:7506;s:76:\"Select which plan will be by default selected when the front-end form loads.\";i:7507;s:86:\"You will be able to complete the payment after you have confirmed your e-mail address.\";i:7508;s:16:\"Member discount!\";i:7509;s:160:\"By checking this option we will cumulate all discounts that apply to a specific product. <strong> By default we\'re applying only the highest discount. </strong>\";i:7510;s:88:\"The paid add-ons can be downloaded from your <a href=\\\"%s\\\">Cozmoslabs Account</a> page.\";i:7511;s:125:\"These addons extend your WordPress Membership Plugin and are available with the <a href=\\\"%s\\\">Hobbyist and PRO</a> versions.\";i:7512;s:116:\"These addons extend your WordPress Membership Plugin and are available with the <a href=\\\"%s\\\">PRO version</a> only.\";i:7513;s:97:\"Paid Member Subscriptions comes with an <a href=\\\"%s\\\">extensive documentation</a> to assist you.\";i:7514;s:17:\"Save Subscription\";i:7515;s:118:\"Select the username you wish to associate a subscription plan with. You can create a new user <a href=\\\"%s\\\">here</a>.\";i:7516;s:106:\"Select the username you wish to assign this payment to. You can create a new user <a href=\\\"%s\\\">here</a>.\";i:7517;s:104:\"If you select \\\"Messages\\\" the post\'s content will be protected by being replaced with a custom message.\";i:7518;s:251:\"If you select \\\"Redirect\\\" the post\'s content will be protected by redirecting the user to the URL you specify. The redirect happens only when accessing a single post. On archive pages the restriction message will be displayed, instead of the content.\";i:7519;s:148:\"If you select \\\"Template\\\" the template for the restricted post/page will change to the selected template in the Restriction Template section below.\";i:7520;s:135:\"Select which template should load instead of the default one when a post is restricted and the restriction type is set to \\\"Template\\\".\";i:7521;s:85:\"You can <a href=\\\"%s\\\">customize this email</a> with Profile Builder Email Customizer\";i:7522;s:57:\"Use Paid Member Subscriptions\'s own CSS in the front-end.\";i:7523;s:81:\"Select \\\"Yes\\\" to automatically log in new members after successful registration.\";i:7524;s:199:\"If the current user\'s session has been taken over by a newer session, we will log him out and he will have to login again. This will make it inconvenient for members to share their login credentials.\";i:7525;s:159:\"By checking this option you will be able to use Paid Member Subscriptions only with test accounts from your payment processors. <a href=\\\"%s\\\">More Details</a>\";i:7526;s:94:\"We\'re sad to see you leave, but we understand that sometimes things don\'t work out as planned.\";i:7527;s:32:\"Enter your PayPal e-mail address\";i:7528;s:108:\"Checking only \\\"Logged In Users\\\" will show this %s to all logged in users, regardless of subscription plan.\";i:7529;s:22:\"Topic Restriction Mode\";i:7530;s:13:\"Forum Default\";i:7531;s:22:\"Hide Topic and Replies\";i:7532;s:28:\"Show Topic, but hide Replies\";i:7533;s:125:\"The option above will work only if the restriction type is Message. Redirects will take effect without regard of this option.\";i:7534;s:19:\"Discounts behaviour\";i:7535;s:10:\"Best price\";i:7536;s:50:\"Exclude this product from all membership discounts\";i:7537;s:141:\"This will calculate the best price for this product, based on all existing member discounts (set both per subscription plan and per product) \";i:7538;s:90:\"This will ignore the global discounts set per subscription plan that apply to this product\";i:7539;s:96:\"This will exclude this product from any membership discounts that may apply now or in the future\";i:7540;s:17:\"Subscription plan\";i:7541;s:16:\"Add New Discount\";i:7542;s:20:\"Membership Discounts\";i:7543;s:12:\"Discount for\";i:7544;s:17:\"Product Discounts\";}}', 'yes');
