(17133, 872, 'descr_seo', 'Each person, going to another city wants to book accommodation. Our website will help you to book an apartment with a guarantee:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>actual photos</li>\r\n 	<li>price without additional fees</li>\r\n 	<li>we meet you in correct time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you have any problems, our support service will always help to solve them quickly.\r\n\r\nWe have standard apartments, unique duplex apartments and luxury apartments. You can easily find the right area among our variety of apartments. For convenience, we have done several types of search:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>on the subway map</li>\r\n 	<li>by dates</li>\r\n 	<li>renovation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nTake care of yourself in advance and book the most comfortable apartment on our website.'),
